I know! (Oh I know)
He cares, (how He cares)
He’s the only one I know who’s always there!
ﾩ 1998 Out of the Ark Music Sefton House, 2 Molesey Road, Walton-On-Thames, KT12 4RQ. Used by permission');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0560', 'chorus', 0, 0, '[\"Oh yeah! (He’ll be there)\",\"Oh yeah! (He’ll be there)\",\"He will never leave me,\",\"I know! (Oh I know)\",\"He cares, (how He cares)\",\"He’s the only one I know who’s always there!\",\"ﾩ 1998 Out of the Ark Music Sefton House, 2 Molesey Road, Walton-On-Thames, KT12 4RQ. Used by permission\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0561', 561, 'Count your blessings', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'PART 3
