we’re gonna see,
we’re gonna see Jesus lifted high,
we’re gonna see,
we’re gonna see
we’re gonna see Jesus lifted high.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0608', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"We’re gonna see,\",\"we’re gonna see,\",\"we’re gonna see Jesus lifted high,\",\"we’re gonna see,\",\"we’re gonna see\",\"we’re gonna see Jesus lifted high.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0609', 609, 'We are climbing', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, '4.    We are one with all who serve Him, serve Him,
We are one with all who serve Him, serve Him,
We are one with all who serve Him, serve Him,
children of the Lord.
So let’s all rise...');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0609', 'chorus', 0, 0, '[\"4.    We are one with all who serve Him, serve Him,\",\"We are one with all who serve Him, serve Him,\",\"We are one with all who serve Him, serve Him,\",\"children of the Lord.\",\"So let’s all rise...\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0610', 610, 'Holy is the Lord', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'It’s rising up all around;
it’s the anthem of the Lord’s renown.
It’s rising up all around;
it’s the anthem of the Lord’s renown.
And together we sing, everyone sing:
Holy is the Lord...');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0610', 'chorus', 0, 0, '[\"It’s rising up all around;\",\"it’s the anthem of the Lord’s renown.\",\"It’s rising up all around;\",\"it’s the anthem of the Lord’s renown.\",\"And together we sing, everyone sing:\",\"Holy is the Lord...\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0611', 611, 'We’re following the star', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'Then there were three wise men living far away,
wanted to see Jesus, sleeping in the hay.
They began their journey and when they arrived
they gave special presents. What a nice surprise!
We’re following the star...
We’re gonna see the baby Jesus Christ,
we’re gonna see the baby Jesus Christ!
ﾩ 2006 Thankyou Music, administered by worshiptogether.com songs excl. UK and Europe, administered by kingswaysongs.com. tym@kingsway.co.uk. Used by permission.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0611', 'verse', 2, 0, '[\"Then there were three wise men living far away,\",\"wanted to see Jesus, sleeping in the hay.\",\"They began their journey and when they arrived\",\"they gave special presents. What a nice surprise!\",\"We’re following the star...\",\"We’re gonna see the baby Jesus Christ,\",\"we’re gonna see the baby Jesus Christ!\",\"ﾩ 2006 Thankyou Music, administered by worshiptogether.com songs excl. UK and Europe, administered by kingswaysongs.com. tym@kingsway.co.uk. Used by permission.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0612', 612, 'Hosanna', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'We’re gonna celebrate, celebrate the goodness of our Lord,
we’re gonna tell the world of all that He has done.
We’re gonna shout and praise and sing His name for now and evermore,
He gives joy to every heart, He gives hope to all who come.
Hosanna, hosanna...
ﾩ 2005 Vineyard Songs (UK/Eire), administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. music@copycare.com. Used by permission.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0612', 'verse', 2, 0, '[\"We’re gonna celebrate, celebrate the goodness of our Lord,\",\"we’re gonna tell the world of all that He has done.\",\"We’re gonna shout and praise and sing His name for now and evermore,\",\"He gives joy to every heart, He gives hope to all who come.\",\"Hosanna, hosanna...\",\"ﾩ 2005 Vineyard Songs (UK\\/Eire), administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. music@copycare.com. Used by permission.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0613', 613, 'Welcome to the family', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'Welcome to the family,
we’re glad that you have come
to share your life with us,
as we grow in love;
and may we always be to you
what God would have us be,
a family always there,
to be strong and to lean on.
ﾩ 1982 Rettino Kerner Publishing / Word Music, administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. music@copycare.com. Used by permission.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0613', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Welcome to the family,\",\"we’re glad that you have come\",\"to share your life with us,\",\"as we grow in love;\",\"and may we always be to you\",\"what God would have us be,\",\"a family always there,\",\"to be strong and to lean on.\",\"ﾩ 1982 Rettino Kerner Publishing \\/ Word Music, administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. music@copycare.com. Used by permission.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0614', 614, 'What greater gift has ever been known', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'But one day soon, across the skies,
You will return before our eyes.
And to their knees all men will fall,
before their King, our Christ, our Lord.
How precious...
ﾩ 2004 Thankyou Music, administered by worshiptogether.com songs excl. UK and Europe, administered by kingswaysongs.com. tym@kingsway.co.uk. Used by permission.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0614', 'verse', 3, 0, '[\"But one day soon, across the skies,\",\"You will return before our eyes.\",\"And to their knees all men will fall,\",\"before their King, our Christ, our Lord.\",\"How precious...\",\"ﾩ 2004 Thankyou Music, administered by worshiptogether.com songs excl. UK and Europe, administered by kingswaysongs.com. tym@kingsway.co.uk. Used by permission.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0615', 615, 'When God made the garden of creation', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'When God made us stewards of creation,
He made us His vision to share,
when God made us stewards of creation,
our burdens He wanted to bear.
He cares for you,
He cares for me,
He cares for all in need;
For God is a father who loves His children,
no matter what colour or creed.
When God made us stewards of creation,
He gave us His vision to share.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0615', 'verse', 4, 0, '[\"When God made us stewards of creation,\",\"He made us His vision to share,\",\"when God made us stewards of creation,\",\"our burdens He wanted to bear.\",\"He cares for you,\",\"He cares for me,\",\"He cares for all in need;\",\"For God is a father who loves His children,\",\"no matter what colour or creed.\",\"When God made us stewards of creation,\",\"He gave us His vision to share.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0616', 616, 'When I think about the cross', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'When I think about the cross,
when I think of Jesus,
I’m reminded of His love,
love that never leaves me.
Who am I that He should die,
giving life so freely?
When I think about the cross,
help me to believe it.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0616', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"When I think about the cross,\",\"when I think of Jesus,\",\"I’m reminded of His love,\",\"love that never leaves me.\",\"Who am I that He should die,\",\"giving life so freely?\",\"When I think about the cross,\",\"help me to believe it.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0617', 617, 'When a knight won his spurs', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'Let faith be my shield and let joy be my steed
’gainst the dragons of anger, the ogres of greed;
and let me set free, with the sword of my youth,');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0617', 'verse', 3, 0, '[\"Let faith be my shield and let joy be my steed\",\"’gainst the dragons of anger, the ogres of greed;\",\"and let me set free, with the sword of my youth,\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0618', 618, 'I will praise You', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'I will, I will, I will praise You,
I will, I will, I will praise You.
Through the sun...
ﾩ 2005 Vineyard Songs (UK/Eire), administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. music@copycare.com. Used by permission.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0618', 'chorus', 0, 0, '[\"I will, I will, I will praise You,\",\"I will, I will, I will praise You.\",\"Through the sun...\",\"ﾩ 2005 Vineyard Songs (UK\\/Eire), administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. music@copycare.com. Used by permission.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0619', 619, 'Who made the twinkling stars', 'JP', 'en', 'control', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'Who made you and me,
you and me, you and me?
Who made you and me?
Our Father God.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0619', 'verse', 4, 0, '[\"Who made you and me,\",\"you and me, you and me?\",\"Who made you and me?\",\"Our Father God.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0620', 620, 'Wonderful Lord', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'Wonderful Lord, wonderful God,
You are my shield, my protector.
I can lie down, go off to sleep,
knowing You’re watching over me.
Wonderful Lord, wonderful God,
help me to trust You forever.
I need not fear
’cause You are near,
I can lie down and sleep in peace.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0620', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Wonderful Lord, wonderful God,\",\"You are my shield, my protector.\",\"I can lie down, go off to sleep,\",\"knowing You’re watching over me.\",\"Wonderful Lord, wonderful God,\",\"help me to trust You forever.\",\"I need not fear\",\"’cause You are near,\",\"I can lie down and sleep in peace.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0621', 621, 'Beautiful One', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'My soul, my soul must sing,
my soul, my soul must sing,
my soul, my soul must sing, beautiful One.
Beautiful One...');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0621', 'chorus', 0, 0, '[\"My soul, my soul must sing,\",\"my soul, my soul must sing,\",\"my soul, my soul must sing, beautiful One.\",\"Beautiful One...\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0622', 622, 'This is love', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'Higher, deeper, wider, stronger;
this is love.
Higher, deeper, wider, stronger;
this is love.
This is love...');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0622', 'chorus', 0, 0, '[\"Higher, deeper, wider, stronger;\",\"this is love.\",\"Higher, deeper, wider, stronger;\",\"this is love.\",\"This is love...\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0623', 623, 'You shall go out with joy', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'You shall go out with joy
and be led forth with peace,
and the mountains and the hills
shall break forth before you.
There’ll be shouts of joy
and the trees of the field
shall clap, shall clap their hands,
and the trees of the field
shall clap their hands,
and the trees of the field
shall clap their hands,
and the trees of the field
shall clap their hands,
and you’ll go out with joy.
ﾩ 1975 Lillenas Publishing Co, administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. Used by permission.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0623', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"You shall go out with joy\",\"and be led forth with peace,\",\"and the mountains and the hills\",\"shall break forth before you.\",\"There’ll be shouts of joy\",\"and the trees of the field\",\"shall clap, shall clap their hands,\",\"and the trees of the field\",\"shall clap their hands,\",\"and the trees of the field\",\"shall clap their hands,\",\"and the trees of the field\",\"shall clap their hands,\",\"and you’ll go out with joy.\",\"ﾩ 1975 Lillenas Publishing Co, administered by CopyCare, PO Box 77, Hailsham BN27 3EF, UK. Used by permission.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('JP-0624', 624, 'Your name is Jesus', 'JP', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 'And with our whole lives bring You praise.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('JP-0624', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"And with our whole lives bring You praise.\"]');
