And through eternity.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0161', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Jesus, the very thought of Thee,\",\"With sweetness fills the breast;\",\"But sweeter far Thy face to see,\",\"And in thy presence rest.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0161', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"No voice can sing, no heart can frame,\",\"Nor can the memory find\",\"A sweeter sound than Jesus\' name,\",\"The Savior of mankind.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0161', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"O hope of every contrite heart!\",\"O joy of all the meek,\",\"To those who fall, how kind thou art!\",\"How good to those who seek!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0161', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"But what to those who find? Ah, this\",\"Nor tongue nor pen can show:\",\"The love of Jesus — what it is,\",\"None but his loved ones know.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0161', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Jesus, our only joy be Thou,\",\"As Thou our prize wilt be;\",\"In Thee be all our glory now,\",\"And through eternity.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0162', 162, 'Crown Him With Many Crowns', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Crown Him with many crowns,
The Lamb upon his throne,
Hark! how the heavenly anthem drowns
All music but its own!
Awake, my soul, and sing
Of Him who died for thee,
And hail Him as thy matchless King
Through all eternity.
Crown Him the Lord of love!
Behold His hands and side,
Those wounds, yet visible above,
In beauty glorified;
No angel in the sky
Can fully bear that sight,
But downward bends his wondering eye
At mysteries so great.
Crown Him the Lord of peace!
Whose hand a scepter sways');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0162', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Crown Him with many crowns,\",\"The Lamb upon his throne,\",\"Hark! how the heavenly anthem drowns\",\"All music but its own!\",\"Awake, my soul, and sing\",\"Of Him who died for thee,\",\"And hail Him as thy matchless King\",\"Through all eternity.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0162', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Crown Him the Lord of love!\",\"Behold His hands and side,\",\"Those wounds, yet visible above,\",\"In beauty glorified;\",\"No angel in the sky\",\"Can fully bear that sight,\",\"But downward bends his wondering eye\",\"At mysteries so great.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0162', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Crown Him the Lord of peace!\",\"Whose hand a scepter sways\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0163', 163, 'There Is a Fountain', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There is a fountain filled with blood
Drawn from Immanuel’s veins;
And sinners plunged beneath that flood,
Lose all their guilty stains,
Lose all their guilty stains,
Lose all their guilty stains;
And sinners plunged beneath that flood,
Lose all their guilty stains.
The dying thief rejoiced to see
That fountain in his day;
And there may I, though vile as he,
Wash all my sins away,
Wash all my sins away,
Wash all my sins away;
And there may I, though vile as he,
Wash all my sins away.
Thou dying Lamb! Thy precious blood
Shall never lose its power,
Till all the ransomed church of God
Are saved, to sin no more,
Are saved, to sin no more,
Are saved, to sin no more;
Till all the ransomed church of God
Are saved, to sin no more.
E’er since by faith I saw the stream
Thy flowing wounds supply,
Redeeming love has been my theme,
And shall be till I die,
And shall be till I die,
And shall be till I die;
Redeeming love has been my theme,
And shall be till I die.
Lord, I believe Thou hast prepared,
Unworthy though I be,
For me a blood-bought free reward,
A golden harp for me!
A golden harp for me!
A golden harp for me!
For me a blood-bought free reward,
A golden harp for me!
There in a nobler, sweeter song,
I’ll sing Thy power to save,
When this poor lisping, stammering tongue
Is ransomed from the grave,
Is ransomed from the grave,
Is ransomed from the grace;
When this poor lisping, stammering tongue
Is ransomed from the grave.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0163', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"There is a fountain filled with blood\",\"Drawn from Immanuel’s veins;\",\"And sinners plunged beneath that flood,\",\"Lose all their guilty stains,\",\"Lose all their guilty stains,\",\"Lose all their guilty stains;\",\"And sinners plunged beneath that flood,\",\"Lose all their guilty stains.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0163', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"The dying thief rejoiced to see\",\"That fountain in his day;\",\"And there may I, though vile as he,\",\"Wash all my sins away,\",\"Wash all my sins away,\",\"Wash all my sins away;\",\"And there may I, though vile as he,\",\"Wash all my sins away.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0163', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Thou dying Lamb! Thy precious blood\",\"Shall never lose its power,\",\"Till all the ransomed church of God\",\"Are saved, to sin no more,\",\"Are saved, to sin no more,\",\"Are saved, to sin no more;\",\"Till all the ransomed church of God\",\"Are saved, to sin no more.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0163', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"E’er since by faith I saw the stream\",\"Thy flowing wounds supply,\",\"Redeeming love has been my theme,\",\"And shall be till I die,\",\"And shall be till I die,\",\"And shall be till I die;\",\"Redeeming love has been my theme,\",\"And shall be till I die.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0163', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Lord, I believe Thou hast prepared,\",\"Unworthy though I be,\",\"For me a blood-bought free reward,\",\"A golden harp for me!\",\"A golden harp for me!\",\"A golden harp for me!\",\"For me a blood-bought free reward,\",\"A golden harp for me!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0163', 'verse', 6, 5, '[\"There in a nobler, sweeter song,\",\"I’ll sing Thy power to save,\",\"When this poor lisping, stammering tongue\",\"Is ransomed from the grave,\",\"Is ransomed from the grave,\",\"Is ransomed from the grace;\",\"When this poor lisping, stammering tongue\",\"Is ransomed from the grave.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0164', 164, 'O Saviour, Precious Saviour', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'O Saviour, precious Saviour,
Whom, yet unseen, we love,
O Name of might and favor,
All other names above!
We worship Thee, we bless Thee,
To Thee, O Christ we sing;
We praise Thee, and confess Thee
Our holy Lord and King.
O bringer of salvation,
Who wondrously hast wrought,
Thyself the revelation
Of love beyond out thought,
We worship Thee, we bless Thee,
To Thee, O Christ we sing;
We praise Thee, and confess Thee
Our gracious Lord and King.
In Thee all fulness dwelleth,
All grace and power divine;
The glory that excelleth,
O Son of God, is Thine;
We worship Thee, we bless Thee,
To Thee, O Christ we sing;
We praise Thee, and confess Thee
Our glorious Lord and King.
O grant the consummation
Of this our song above,
In endless adoration,
And everlasting love;
Then shall we praise and bless Thee
Where perfect praises ring,
And evermore confess Thee
Our Saviour and our King.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0164', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"O Saviour, precious Saviour,\",\"Whom, yet unseen, we love,\",\"O Name of might and favor,\",\"All other names above!\",\"We worship Thee, we bless Thee,\",\"To Thee, O Christ we sing;\",\"We praise Thee, and confess Thee\",\"Our holy Lord and King.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0164', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"O bringer of salvation,\",\"Who wondrously hast wrought,\",\"Thyself the revelation\",\"Of love beyond out thought,\",\"We worship Thee, we bless Thee,\",\"To Thee, O Christ we sing;\",\"We praise Thee, and confess Thee\",\"Our gracious Lord and King.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0164', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"In Thee all fulness dwelleth,\",\"All grace and power divine;\",\"The glory that excelleth,\",\"O Son of God, is Thine;\",\"We worship Thee, we bless Thee,\",\"To Thee, O Christ we sing;\",\"We praise Thee, and confess Thee\",\"Our glorious Lord and King.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0164', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"O grant the consummation\",\"Of this our song above,\",\"In endless adoration,\",\"And everlasting love;\",\"Then shall we praise and bless Thee\",\"Where perfect praises ring,\",\"And evermore confess Thee\",\"Our Saviour and our King.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0165', 165, 'Fairest Lord Jesus', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Fairest Lord Jesus,
Ruler of all nature,
O Thou of God and man the Son!
Thee will I cherish,
Thee will I honor,
Thou art my glory, joy, and crown.
Fair are the meadows,
Fairer still the woodlands,
Robed in the blooming garb of spring;
Jesus is fairer,
Jesus is purer,
Who makes the woeful heart to sing.
Fair is the sunshine,
Fairer still the moonlight,
And all the twinkling, starry host;
Jesus shines brighter,
Jesus shines purer
Than all the angels heaven can boast.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0165', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Fairest Lord Jesus,\",\"Ruler of all nature,\",\"O Thou of God and man the Son!\",\"Thee will I cherish,\",\"Thee will I honor,\",\"Thou art my glory, joy, and crown.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0165', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Fair are the meadows,\",\"Fairer still the woodlands,\",\"Robed in the blooming garb of spring;\",\"Jesus is fairer,\",\"Jesus is purer,\",\"Who makes the woeful heart to sing.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0165', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Fair is the sunshine,\",\"Fairer still the moonlight,\",\"And all the twinkling, starry host;\",\"Jesus shines brighter,\",\"Jesus shines purer\",\"Than all the angels heaven can boast.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0166', 166, 'Jesus, These Eyes Have Never Seen', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jesus, these eyes have never seen,
That radiant form of Thine;
The veil of sense hangs dark between
Thy blessed face and mine.
I see Thee not, I hear Thee not,
Yet art Thou oft with me;
And earth hath ne’er so dear a spot,
As where I meet with Thee.
Like some bright dream that comes unsought,
When slumbers o’er me roll,
Thine image ever fills my thought,
And charms my ravished soul.
Yet though I have not seen, and still
Must rest in faith alone,
I love Thee, dearest Lord, and will,
Unseen, but not unknown.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0166', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Jesus, these eyes have never seen,\",\"That radiant form of Thine;\",\"The veil of sense hangs dark between\",\"Thy blessed face and mine.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0166', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"I see Thee not, I hear Thee not,\",\"Yet art Thou oft with me;\",\"And earth hath ne’er so dear a spot,\",\"As where I meet with Thee.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0166', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Like some bright dream that comes unsought,\",\"When slumbers o’er me roll,\",\"Thine image ever fills my thought,\",\"And charms my ravished soul.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0166', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Yet though I have not seen, and still\",\"Must rest in faith alone,\",\"I love Thee, dearest Lord, and will,\",\"Unseen, but not unknown.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0167', 167, 'Shepherd of Tender Youth', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shepherd of tender youth,
Guiding in love and truth,
Through devious way;
Christ our triumphant King,
We come Thy name to sing,
Hither our children bring
To shout Thy praise.
Thou are our holy Lord,
The all subduing Word,
Healer of strife;
Thou didst Thyself abase,
That from sin’s deep disgrace
Thou mightest save our race,
And give us life.
Thou art the great High Priest;
Thou hast prepared the feast
Of heavenly love;
While in our mortal pain
None calls on Thee in vain;
Help Thou dost not disdain,
Help from above.
Ever be Thou our Guide,
Our Shepherd and our pride,
Our staff and song;
Jesus, Thou Christ of God,
By Thy perennial word,
Lead us where Thou hast trod,
Make our faith strong.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0167', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Shepherd of tender youth,\",\"Guiding in love and truth,\",\"Through devious way;\",\"Christ our triumphant King,\",\"We come Thy name to sing,\",\"Hither our children bring\",\"To shout Thy praise.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0167', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Thou are our holy Lord,\",\"The all subduing Word,\",\"Healer of strife;\",\"Thou didst Thyself abase,\",\"That from sin’s deep disgrace\",\"Thou mightest save our race,\",\"And give us life.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0167', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Thou art the great High Priest;\",\"Thou hast prepared the feast\",\"Of heavenly love;\",\"While in our mortal pain\",\"None calls on Thee in vain;\",\"Help Thou dost not disdain,\",\"Help from above.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0167', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Ever be Thou our Guide,\",\"Our Shepherd and our pride,\",\"Our staff and song;\",\"Jesus, Thou Christ of God,\",\"By Thy perennial word,\",\"Lead us where Thou hast trod,\",\"Make our faith strong.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0168', 168, 'Worthy, Worthy Is the Lamb', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Worthy, worthy is the Lamb,
Worthy, worthy is the Lamb;
Worthy, worthy is the Lamb
That was slain.
Glory, hallelujah!
Praise Him, hallelujah!
Glory, hallelujah!
To the Lamb!
Savior, let Thy kingdom come!
Now the power of sin consume;
Bring Thy blest millennium,
Holy Lamb.
Thus may we each moment feel,
Love Him, serve Him, praise Him still,
Till we all on Zion\'s hill
See the Lamb.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0168', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Worthy, worthy is the Lamb,\",\"Worthy, worthy is the Lamb;\",\"Worthy, worthy is the Lamb\",\"That was slain.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0168', 'chorus', 0, 1, '[\"Glory, hallelujah!\",\"Praise Him, hallelujah!\",\"Glory, hallelujah!\",\"To the Lamb!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0168', 'verse', 2, 2, '[\"Savior, let Thy kingdom come!\",\"Now the power of sin consume;\",\"Bring Thy blest millennium,\",\"Holy Lamb.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0168', 'verse', 3, 3, '[\"Thus may we each moment feel,\",\"Love Him, serve Him, praise Him still,\",\"Till we all on Zion\'s hill\",\"See the Lamb.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0169', 169, 'Thou Hidden Source', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thou hidden source of calm repose,
Thou all-sufficient love divine;
My help and refuge from my foes,
Secure I am if thou art mine,');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0169', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Thou hidden source of calm repose,\",\"Thou all-sufficient love divine;\",\"My help and refuge from my foes,\",\"Secure I am if thou art mine,\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0170', 170, 'Beyond the Starry Skies', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Beyond the starry skies,
Far as th\'eternal hills,
There, in the soundless world of light
Our great Redeemer dwells.
Around Him angels fair,
In countless armies shine;
And ever, in exalted lays,
They offer songs divine.
\"Hail, Prince of life!\" they cry,
\"Whose unexampled love
Moved Thee to quit those glorious realms
And royalties above.\"
And when He stooped to earth,
And suffered rude disdain,
They cast their honors at His feet,
And waited in His train.
They saw Him on the cross,
While darkness veiled the skies;
And when He burst the gates of death,
They saw the Conqueror rise.
They thronged His chariot wheels,
And bore Him to His throne;
Then swept their golden harps and sang,
\"That glorious work is done.\"');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0170', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Beyond the starry skies,\",\"Far as th\'eternal hills,\",\"There, in the soundless world of light\",\"Our great Redeemer dwells.\",\"Around Him angels fair,\",\"In countless armies shine;\",\"And ever, in exalted lays,\",\"They offer songs divine.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0170', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"\\\"Hail, Prince of life!\\\" they cry,\",\"\\\"Whose unexampled love\",\"Moved Thee to quit those glorious realms\",\"And royalties above.\\\"\",\"And when He stooped to earth,\",\"And suffered rude disdain,\",\"They cast their honors at His feet,\",\"And waited in His train.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0170', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"They saw Him on the cross,\",\"While darkness veiled the skies;\",\"And when He burst the gates of death,\",\"They saw the Conqueror rise.\",\"They thronged His chariot wheels,\",\"And bore Him to His throne;\",\"Then swept their golden harps and sang,\",\"\\\"That glorious work is done.\\\"\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0171', 171, 'There Is a Name I Love', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There is a name I love to hear,
I love to sing its worth;
It sounds like music in mine ear,
The sweetest name on earth.
It tells me of a Saviour\'s love,
Who died to set me free;
It tells me of His precious blood,
The sinner\'s perfect plea.
It tells me of a Father’s smile
Beaming upon His child;
It cheers me through this little while,
Through desert, waste, and wild.
Jesus, the name I love so well,
The name I love to hear;
No saint on earth its worth can tell,
No heart conceive how dear.
This Name shall shed its fragrance still
Along this thorny road,
Shall sweetly smooth the rugged hill
That leads me up to God.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0171', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"There is a name I love to hear,\",\"I love to sing its worth;\",\"It sounds like music in mine ear,\",\"The sweetest name on earth.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0171', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"It tells me of a Saviour\'s love,\",\"Who died to set me free;\",\"It tells me of His precious blood,\",\"The sinner\'s perfect plea.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0171', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"It tells me of a Father’s smile\",\"Beaming upon His child;\",\"It cheers me through this little while,\",\"Through desert, waste, and wild.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0171', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Jesus, the name I love so well,\",\"The name I love to hear;\",\"No saint on earth its worth can tell,\",\"No heart conceive how dear.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0171', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"This Name shall shed its fragrance still\",\"Along this thorny road,\",\"Shall sweetly smooth the rugged hill\",\"That leads me up to God.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0172', 172, 'Come, Sound His Praise', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, sound His praise abroad,
And hymns of glory sing;
Jehovah is the sovereign God,
The universal King.
He formed the deeps unknown;
He gave the seas their bound;
The watery worlds are all His own,
And His the solid ground.
Come, worship at His throne,
Come, bow before the Lord;
We are His works, and not our own;
He formed us by His word.
Today attend His voice,
Nor dare provoke His rod;
Come, like the people of His choice,
And own your gracious God.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0172', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Come, sound His praise abroad,\",\"And hymns of glory sing;\",\"Jehovah is the sovereign God,\",\"The universal King.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0172', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"He formed the deeps unknown;\",\"He gave the seas their bound;\",\"The watery worlds are all His own,\",\"And His the solid ground.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0172', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Come, worship at His throne,\",\"Come, bow before the Lord;\",\"We are His works, and not our own;\",\"He formed us by His word.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0172', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Today attend His voice,\",\"Nor dare provoke His rod;\",\"Come, like the people of His choice,\",\"And own your gracious God.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0173', 173, 'O brother, Be Faithful', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'O brother be faithful! soon Jesus will come,
For whom we have waited so long;
O, soon we shall enter our glorious home,
And join in the conqueror\'s song.
O brother be faithful! for why should we prove
Unfaithful to Him who had shown
Such deep, such unbounded and infinite love�
Who died to redeem us His own.
O brother be faithful! the city of gold,
Prepared for the good and the blest,
Is waiting its portals of pearl to unfold,
And welcome thee into thy rest.
Then, brother prove faithful! not long shall we stay
In weariness here, and forlorn,
Time\'s dark night of sorrow is wearing away,
We haste to the glorious morn.
O brother be faithful! He soon will descend,
Creation\'s omnipotent King,
While legions of angels His chariot attend,
And palm wreaths, of victory bring.
O brother be faithful! and soon shalt thou hear
Thy Saviour pronounce the glad word,
Well done, faithful servant, thy title is clear,
To enter the joy of thy Lord.
O brother be faithful! eternity\'s years
Shall tell for thy faithfulness now,
When bright smiles of gladness shall scatter thy tears,
A coronet gleam on thy brow.
O brother be faithful! the promise is sure,
That waits for the faithful and tried;
To reign with the ransomed, immortal and pure,
And ever with Jesus abide.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0173', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"O brother be faithful! soon Jesus will come,\",\"For whom we have waited so long;\",\"O, soon we shall enter our glorious home,\",\"And join in the conqueror\'s song.\",\"O brother be faithful! for why should we prove\",\"Unfaithful to Him who had shown\",\"Such deep, such unbounded and infinite love�\",\"Who died to redeem us His own.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0173', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"O brother be faithful! the city of gold,\",\"Prepared for the good and the blest,\",\"Is waiting its portals of pearl to unfold,\",\"And welcome thee into thy rest.\",\"Then, brother prove faithful! not long shall we stay\",\"In weariness here, and forlorn,\",\"Time\'s dark night of sorrow is wearing away,\",\"We haste to the glorious morn.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0173', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"O brother be faithful! He soon will descend,\",\"Creation\'s omnipotent King,\",\"While legions of angels His chariot attend,\",\"And palm wreaths, of victory bring.\",\"O brother be faithful! and soon shalt thou hear\",\"Thy Saviour pronounce the glad word,\",\"Well done, faithful servant, thy title is clear,\",\"To enter the joy of thy Lord.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0173', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"O brother be faithful! eternity\'s years\",\"Shall tell for thy faithfulness now,\",\"When bright smiles of gladness shall scatter thy tears,\",\"A coronet gleam on thy brow.\",\"O brother be faithful! the promise is sure,\",\"That waits for the faithful and tried;\",\"To reign with the ransomed, immortal and pure,\",\"And ever with Jesus abide.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0174', 174, 'Come, Lord, and Tarry Not', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, Lord, and tarry not;
Bring the longlookedfor day;
O why these years of waiting here?
O why this long delay?
Come, for creation groans,
Impatient of Thy stay;
Worn out by these long years of ill,
These ages of delay.
Come, for the corn is ripe!
Put in Thy sickle now;
Reap the great harvest of the earth;
Sower and reaper Thou.
Come, spoil the strong man\'s house,
Bind him and cast him hence;
Show Thyself stronger than the strong,
Thyself Omnipotence.
Come, and begin Thy reign
Of everlasting peace;
Come, take the kingdom to Thyself,
Great King of righteousness.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0174', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Come, Lord, and tarry not;\",\"Bring the longlookedfor day;\",\"O why these years of waiting here?\",\"O why this long delay?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0174', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Come, for creation groans,\",\"Impatient of Thy stay;\",\"Worn out by these long years of ill,\",\"These ages of delay.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0174', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Come, for the corn is ripe!\",\"Put in Thy sickle now;\",\"Reap the great harvest of the earth;\",\"Sower and reaper Thou.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0174', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Come, spoil the strong man\'s house,\",\"Bind him and cast him hence;\",\"Show Thyself stronger than the strong,\",\"Thyself Omnipotence.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0174', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Come, and begin Thy reign\",\"Of everlasting peace;\",\"Come, take the kingdom to Thyself,\",\"Great King of righteousness.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0175', 175, 'Awake, Ye Saints', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Awake, ye saints, and raise your eyes,
And raise your voices high;
Awake, and praise that sovereign love,
That shows salvation nigh;
Awake, and praise that sovereign love,
That shows salvation nigh.
Swift on the wings of time it flies;
Each moment brings it near;
Then welcome each declining day,
Welcome each closing year;
Then welcome each declining day,
Welcome each closing year.
Not many years their round shall run,
Not many mornings rise,
Ere all its glories stand revealed
To our admiring eyes;
Ere all its glories stand revealed
To our admiring eyes.
Ye wheels of nature, speed your course!
Ye mortal powers, decay!
Haste! till the last glad morning rise
That brings eternal day;
Haste! till the last glad morning rise
That brings eternal day.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0175', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Awake, ye saints, and raise your eyes,\",\"And raise your voices high;\",\"Awake, and praise that sovereign love,\",\"That shows salvation nigh;\",\"Awake, and praise that sovereign love,\",\"That shows salvation nigh.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0175', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Swift on the wings of time it flies;\",\"Each moment brings it near;\",\"Then welcome each declining day,\",\"Welcome each closing year;\",\"Then welcome each declining day,\",\"Welcome each closing year.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0175', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Not many years their round shall run,\",\"Not many mornings rise,\",\"Ere all its glories stand revealed\",\"To our admiring eyes;\",\"Ere all its glories stand revealed\",\"To our admiring eyes.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0175', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Ye wheels of nature, speed your course!\",\"Ye mortal powers, decay!\",\"Haste! till the last glad morning rise\",\"That brings eternal day;\",\"Haste! till the last glad morning rise\",\"That brings eternal day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0176', 176, 'Lo! He Comes', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lo! He comes, with clouds descending,
Once for favored sinners slain;
Countless angels, Him attending,
Swell the triumph of His train:
Hallelujah! Hallelujah!
Jesus comes, and comes to reign.
Every eye shall now behold Him
Robed in dreadful majesty!
Those who set at nought and sold Him,
Pierced, and nailed Him to the tree,
Deeply wailing, Deeply wailing,
Shall the true Mesiah see!
When the solemn trump has sounded,
Heaven and earth shall flee away;
All who hate Him, must, confounded,
Hear the summons of that day —
\"Come to judgment! Come to judgment!
Come to judgment! Come away!\"
Yea, amen! let all adore Thee,
High on Thy eternal throne!
Saviour, take the power and glory,
Make Thy righteous sentence known;
O come quickly, O come quickly,
Claim the kingdom for Thine own!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0176', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Lo! He comes, with clouds descending,\",\"Once for favored sinners slain;\",\"Countless angels, Him attending,\",\"Swell the triumph of His train:\",\"Hallelujah! Hallelujah!\",\"Jesus comes, and comes to reign.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0176', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Every eye shall now behold Him\",\"Robed in dreadful majesty!\",\"Those who set at nought and sold Him,\",\"Pierced, and nailed Him to the tree,\",\"Deeply wailing, Deeply wailing,\",\"Shall the true Mesiah see!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0176', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"When the solemn trump has sounded,\",\"Heaven and earth shall flee away;\",\"All who hate Him, must, confounded,\",\"Hear the summons of that day —\",\"\\\"Come to judgment! Come to judgment!\",\"Come to judgment! Come away!\\\"\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0176', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Yea, amen! let all adore Thee,\",\"High on Thy eternal throne!\",\"Saviour, take the power and glory,\",\"Make Thy righteous sentence known;\",\"O come quickly, O come quickly,\",\"Claim the kingdom for Thine own!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0177', 177, 'The Church Has Waited Long', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The church has waited long
Her absent Lord to see;
And still in loneliness she waits,
A friendless stranger she.
How long, O Lord our God,
Holy and true and good,
Wilt Thou not judge Thy suffering church,
Her sighs and tears and blood?
Saint after saint on earth,
Has lived, and loved, and died;
And as they left us one by one,
We laid them side by side.
We laid them down to sleep,
But not in hope forlorn;
We laid them but to slumber there,
Till the last glorious morn.
We long to hear Thy voice,
To see Thee face to face,
To share Thy crown and glory then,
As now we share Thy grace.
Come, Lord, and wipe away
The curse, the sin, the stain,
And make this blighted world of ours
Thine own fair world again.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0177', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"The church has waited long\",\"Her absent Lord to see;\",\"And still in loneliness she waits,\",\"A friendless stranger she.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0177', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"How long, O Lord our God,\",\"Holy and true and good,\",\"Wilt Thou not judge Thy suffering church,\",\"Her sighs and tears and blood?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0177', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Saint after saint on earth,\",\"Has lived, and loved, and died;\",\"And as they left us one by one,\",\"We laid them side by side.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0177', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"We laid them down to sleep,\",\"But not in hope forlorn;\",\"We laid them but to slumber there,\",\"Till the last glorious morn.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0177', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"We long to hear Thy voice,\",\"To see Thee face to face,\",\"To share Thy crown and glory then,\",\"As now we share Thy grace.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0177', 'verse', 6, 5, '[\"Come, Lord, and wipe away\",\"The curse, the sin, the stain,\",\"And make this blighted world of ours\",\"Thine own fair world again.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0178', 178, 'In the Sun, and Moon, and Stars', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'In the sun, and moon, and stars,
Signs and wonders have appeared;
Earth has groaned with bloody wars,
And the hearts of men have feared.
Soon shall ocean’s hoary deep,
Tossed with stronger tempests, rise;
Darker storms the mountain sweep,
Fiercer lightning rend the skies.
Dread alarms shall shake the proud,
Pale amazement, restless fear;
And, amid the thunder-cloud,
Shall the Judge of men appear.
But, though from His awful face,
Heaven shall fade, and earth shall fly,
Fear not, ye, His chosen race,
Your redemption draweth nigh.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0178', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"In the sun, and moon, and stars,\",\"Signs and wonders have appeared;\",\"Earth has groaned with bloody wars,\",\"And the hearts of men have feared.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0178', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Soon shall ocean’s hoary deep,\",\"Tossed with stronger tempests, rise;\",\"Darker storms the mountain sweep,\",\"Fiercer lightning rend the skies.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0178', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Dread alarms shall shake the proud,\",\"Pale amazement, restless fear;\",\"And, amid the thunder-cloud,\",\"Shall the Judge of men appear.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0178', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"But, though from His awful face,\",\"Heaven shall fade, and earth shall fly,\",\"Fear not, ye, His chosen race,\",\"Your redemption draweth nigh.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0179', 179, 'He Reigns! the Lord, the Saviour, Reigns', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'He reigns! the Lord, the Savior reigns;
Sing to His name in lofty strains,
Let all the saints in songs rejoice,
And in His praise exalt their voice.
Deep are his counsels, and unknown,
But grace and truth support His throne;
Though gloomy clouds His ways surround,
Justice is their eternal ground.
In robes of judgment, lo, he comes!
Shakes the wide earth and cleaves the tombs;
Before him burns devouring fire;
The mountains melt, the seas retire.
His enemies, with wild dismay,
Fly from the sight, and shun the day;
Then lift your heads, ye saints, on high,
And sing, for your redemption\'s nigh.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0179', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"He reigns! the Lord, the Savior reigns;\",\"Sing to His name in lofty strains,\",\"Let all the saints in songs rejoice,\",\"And in His praise exalt their voice.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0179', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Deep are his counsels, and unknown,\",\"But grace and truth support His throne;\",\"Though gloomy clouds His ways surround,\",\"Justice is their eternal ground.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0179', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"In robes of judgment, lo, he comes!\",\"Shakes the wide earth and cleaves the tombs;\",\"Before him burns devouring fire;\",\"The mountains melt, the seas retire.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0179', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"His enemies, with wild dismay,\",\"Fly from the sight, and shun the day;\",\"Then lift your heads, ye saints, on high,\",\"And sing, for your redemption\'s nigh.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0180', 180, 'Watchman, Tell me', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Watchman, tell me, does the morning
Of fair Zion’s glory dawn?
Have the signs that mark its coming
Yet upon thy pathway shone?
Pilgrim, yes! arise, look round thee;
Light is breaking in the skies;
Gird thy bridal robes around thee,
Morning dawns, arise! arise!
Watchman, see, the light is beaming
Brighter still upon thy way;
Signs through all the earth are gleaming,
Omens of the coming day,
When the Jubal trumpet, sounding,
Shall awake from earth and sea
All the saints of God now sleeping,
Clad in immortality.
Watchman, hail the light ascending
Of the grand, sabbatic year;
All with voices loud proclaiming
That the kingdom now is near;
Pilgrim, yes, I see just yonder,
Cannan’s glorious heights arise;
Salem, too appears in grandeur,
Towering ‘neath its sunlit skies.
Watchman, in the golden city,
Seated on His jasper throne,
Zion’s King, arrayed in beauty,
Reigns in peace from zone to zone;
There, on sunlit hills and mountains,
Golden beams serenely glow;
Purling streams and crystal fountains,
On whose banks sweet flowerets blow.
Watchman, see, the land is nearing,
With its vernal fruits and flowers;
On, just yonder — O, how cheering!
Bloom forever Eden’s bowers;
Hark, the choral strains are ringing,
Wafted on the balmy air;
See the millions, hear them singing,
Soon the pilgrims will be there.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0180', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Watchman, tell me, does the morning\",\"Of fair Zion’s glory dawn?\",\"Have the signs that mark its coming\",\"Yet upon thy pathway shone?\",\"Pilgrim, yes! arise, look round thee;\",\"Light is breaking in the skies;\",\"Gird thy bridal robes around thee,\",\"Morning dawns, arise! arise!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0180', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Watchman, see, the light is beaming\",\"Brighter still upon thy way;\",\"Signs through all the earth are gleaming,\",\"Omens of the coming day,\",\"When the Jubal trumpet, sounding,\",\"Shall awake from earth and sea\",\"All the saints of God now sleeping,\",\"Clad in immortality.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0180', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Watchman, hail the light ascending\",\"Of the grand, sabbatic year;\",\"All with voices loud proclaiming\",\"That the kingdom now is near;\",\"Pilgrim, yes, I see just yonder,\",\"Cannan’s glorious heights arise;\",\"Salem, too appears in grandeur,\",\"Towering ‘neath its sunlit skies.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0180', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Watchman, in the golden city,\",\"Seated on His jasper throne,\",\"Zion’s King, arrayed in beauty,\",\"Reigns in peace from zone to zone;\",\"There, on sunlit hills and mountains,\",\"Golden beams serenely glow;\",\"Purling streams and crystal fountains,\",\"On whose banks sweet flowerets blow.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0180', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Watchman, see, the land is nearing,\",\"With its vernal fruits and flowers;\",\"On, just yonder — O, how cheering!\",\"Bloom forever Eden’s bowers;\",\"Hark, the choral strains are ringing,\",\"Wafted on the balmy air;\",\"See the millions, hear them singing,\",\"Soon the pilgrims will be there.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0181', 181, 'Ye Who Rose To Meet the Lord', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ye who rose to meet the Lord,
Ventured on His faithful word,
Faint not now, for your reward
Will be quickly given.
Faint not, always watch and pray;
Jesus will not more delay;
Even now \'tis dawn of day;
Daystar beams from heaven.
Would ye to the end endure?
Keep the wedding garment pure,
Claim ye still the promise sure,
Faithful is the Lord!
Let your lamps be burning bright;
In God\'s word is beaming light;
Live by faith, and not by sight —
Crowns are your reward.
Tones of thunder through the sky,
Angel voices sounding high,
Echo still the mighty cry,
\"Jesus, quickly come!\"
Quickly He\'ll return again,
With His saints He\'ll come to reign,
While all heaven will shout, \"Amen!
Welcome to Thy throne!\"
Marriage supper now prepared,
By the guests will then be shared,
In fair, righteous robes arrayed,
Like the Bridegroom King.
Glory to Jehovah\'s name!
Sound aloud the glad acclaim,
To the Lamb that once was slain,
Alleluias bring!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0181', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Ye who rose to meet the Lord,\",\"Ventured on His faithful word,\",\"Faint not now, for your reward\",\"Will be quickly given.\",\"Faint not, always watch and pray;\",\"Jesus will not more delay;\",\"Even now \'tis dawn of day;\",\"Daystar beams from heaven.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0181', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Would ye to the end endure?\",\"Keep the wedding garment pure,\",\"Claim ye still the promise sure,\",\"Faithful is the Lord!\",\"Let your lamps be burning bright;\",\"In God\'s word is beaming light;\",\"Live by faith, and not by sight —\",\"Crowns are your reward.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0181', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Tones of thunder through the sky,\",\"Angel voices sounding high,\",\"Echo still the mighty cry,\",\"\\\"Jesus, quickly come!\\\"\",\"Quickly He\'ll return again,\",\"With His saints He\'ll come to reign,\",\"While all heaven will shout, \\\"Amen!\",\"Welcome to Thy throne!\\\"\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0181', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Marriage supper now prepared,\",\"By the guests will then be shared,\",\"In fair, righteous robes arrayed,\",\"Like the Bridegroom King.\",\"Glory to Jehovah\'s name!\",\"Sound aloud the glad acclaim,\",\"To the Lamb that once was slain,\",\"Alleluias bring!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0182', 182, '\'Tis Almost Time For the Lord to Come', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '’Tis almost time for the Lord to come,
I hear the people say;
The stars of heaven are growing dim,
It must be the breaking of the day.
O it must be the breaking of the day!
O it must be the breaking of the day!
The night is almost gone,
The day is coming on;
O it must be the breaking of the day!
The signs foretold in the sun and moon,
In earth and sea and sky,
Aloud proclaim to all mankind,
The coming of the Master draweth nigh.
It must be time for the waiting church
To cast her pride away,
With girded loins and burning lamps,
To look for the breaking of the day.
Go quickly out in the streets and lanes
And in the broad highway,
And call the maimed, the halt, and blind,
To be ready for the breaking of the day.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0182', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"’Tis almost time for the Lord to come,\",\"I hear the people say;\",\"The stars of heaven are growing dim,\",\"It must be the breaking of the day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0182', 'chorus', 0, 1, '[\"O it must be the breaking of the day!\",\"O it must be the breaking of the day!\",\"The night is almost gone,\",\"The day is coming on;\",\"O it must be the breaking of the day!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0182', 'verse', 2, 2, '[\"The signs foretold in the sun and moon,\",\"In earth and sea and sky,\",\"Aloud proclaim to all mankind,\",\"The coming of the Master draweth nigh.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0182', 'verse', 3, 3, '[\"It must be time for the waiting church\",\"To cast her pride away,\",\"With girded loins and burning lamps,\",\"To look for the breaking of the day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0182', 'verse', 4, 4, '[\"Go quickly out in the streets and lanes\",\"And in the broad highway,\",\"And call the maimed, the halt, and blind,\",\"To be ready for the breaking of the day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0183', 183, 'Let Every Lamp Be Burning', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Let every lamp be burning bright,
The darkest hour is nearing;
The darkest hour of earth\'s long night,
Before the Lord\'s appearing.
Then trim your lamps, my brethren dear,
Then trim your lamps with godly fear;
The Master\'s coming draweth near,
Let every lamp be burning.
Though thousands calmly slumber on,
The last great message spuring,
Wel\'ll rest our living faith upon
His promise of returning.
His word our lamp, His truth our guide,
We cannot be mistaken;
Though dangers rise on every side,
We shall not be forsaken.
Then let good works with faith appear,
To help the world atound us;
Obedience bring the blessing near
When faith has firmly bound us.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0183', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Let every lamp be burning bright,\",\"The darkest hour is nearing;\",\"The darkest hour of earth\'s long night,\",\"Before the Lord\'s appearing.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0183', 'chorus', 0, 1, '[\"Then trim your lamps, my brethren dear,\",\"Then trim your lamps with godly fear;\",\"The Master\'s coming draweth near,\",\"Let every lamp be burning.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0183', 'verse', 2, 2, '[\"Though thousands calmly slumber on,\",\"The last great message spuring,\",\"Wel\'ll rest our living faith upon\",\"His promise of returning.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0183', 'verse', 3, 3, '[\"His word our lamp, His truth our guide,\",\"We cannot be mistaken;\",\"Though dangers rise on every side,\",\"We shall not be forsaken.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0183', 'verse', 4, 4, '[\"Then let good works with faith appear,\",\"To help the world atound us;\",\"Obedience bring the blessing near\",\"When faith has firmly bound us.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0184', 184, 'Watchmen, on the Walls of Zion', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Watchmen, on the walls of Zion,
What O tell us, of the night?
Is the daystar now arising?
Will the morn soon greet our sight?
O\'er your vision
Shine there now some rays of light?
O\'er your vision
Shine there now some rays of light?
Tell, O tell us, are the landmarks
On our voyage all passed by?
Are we nearing now the haven?
Can we e\'en the land descry?
Do we truly
See the heavenly kingdom nigh?
Do we truly
See the heavenly kingdom nigh?
Light is beaming, day is coming!
Let us sound aloud the cry;
We behold the daystar rising
Pure and bright in yonder sky!
Saints, be joyful;
Your redemption draweth nigh;
Saints, be joyful;
Your redemption draweth nigh.
We have found the chart and compass,
And are sure the land is near;
Onward, onward we are hasting,
Soon the haven will appear;
Let your voices
Sound aloud your holy cheer;
Let your voices
Sound aloud your holy cheer.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0184', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Watchmen, on the walls of Zion,\",\"What O tell us, of the night?\",\"Is the daystar now arising?\",\"Will the morn soon greet our sight?\",\"O\'er your vision\",\"Shine there now some rays of light?\",\"O\'er your vision\",\"Shine there now some rays of light?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0184', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Tell, O tell us, are the landmarks\",\"On our voyage all passed by?\",\"Are we nearing now the haven?\",\"Can we e\'en the land descry?\",\"Do we truly\",\"See the heavenly kingdom nigh?\",\"Do we truly\",\"See the heavenly kingdom nigh?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0184', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Light is beaming, day is coming!\",\"Let us sound aloud the cry;\",\"We behold the daystar rising\",\"Pure and bright in yonder sky!\",\"Saints, be joyful;\",\"Your redemption draweth nigh;\",\"Saints, be joyful;\",\"Your redemption draweth nigh.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0184', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"We have found the chart and compass,\",\"And are sure the land is near;\",\"Onward, onward we are hasting,\",\"Soon the haven will appear;\",\"Let your voices\",\"Sound aloud your holy cheer;\",\"Let your voices\",\"Sound aloud your holy cheer.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0185', 185, 'Heir of the Kingdom', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Heir of the kingdom, O why dost thou slumber?
Why art thou sleeping so near thy blest home?
Wake thee, arouse thee, and gird on thine armor,
Speed, for the moments are hurrying on.
Heir of the kingdom, say, why dost thou linger?
How canst thou tarry in sight of the prize?
Up, and adorn thee, the Savior is coming;
Haste to receive Him descending the skies.
Earth\'s mighty nations, in strife and commotion,
Tremble with terror, and sink in dismay;
Listen, \'tis nought but the chariot\'s loud rumbling;
Heir of the kingdom, no longer delay.
Stay not, O stay not for earth\'s vain allurements!
See how its glory is passing away;
Break the strong fetters the foe hath bound o\'er thee;
Heir of the kingdom, turn, turn thee away.
Keep the eye single, the head upward lifted;
Watch for the glory of earth\'s coming King;
Lo! o\'er the mountaintops light is now breaking;
Heirs of the kingdom, rejoice ye and sing.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0185', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Heir of the kingdom, O why dost thou slumber?\",\"Why art thou sleeping so near thy blest home?\",\"Wake thee, arouse thee, and gird on thine armor,\",\"Speed, for the moments are hurrying on.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0185', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Heir of the kingdom, say, why dost thou linger?\",\"How canst thou tarry in sight of the prize?\",\"Up, and adorn thee, the Savior is coming;\",\"Haste to receive Him descending the skies.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0185', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Earth\'s mighty nations, in strife and commotion,\",\"Tremble with terror, and sink in dismay;\",\"Listen, \'tis nought but the chariot\'s loud rumbling;\",\"Heir of the kingdom, no longer delay.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0185', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Stay not, O stay not for earth\'s vain allurements!\",\"See how its glory is passing away;\",\"Break the strong fetters the foe hath bound o\'er thee;\",\"Heir of the kingdom, turn, turn thee away.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0185', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Keep the eye single, the head upward lifted;\",\"Watch for the glory of earth\'s coming King;\",\"Lo! o\'er the mountaintops light is now breaking;\",\"Heirs of the kingdom, rejoice ye and sing.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0186', 186, 'Long For My Saviour I’ve Been Waiting', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Long for my Saviour I’ve been waiting,
Long time have watched by night and day;
Feared, lest my faith and hope abating,
I should lose courage by the way.
Jesus soon is coming;
This is my song —
Cheers the heart when joys depart,
And foes are pressing strong.
Here in this vale of sin and sorrow
I have been wandering many years,
Still looking for that happy morrow
When God would wipe away my tears.
Oftimes the tempter comes in power,
Fain then would lead my steps astray;
But when the clouds begin to lower,
Hope turns the darkness into day.
O it will be but little longer
I must these many woes endure;
Then let my faith and hope grow stronger;
My Father\'s promise still is sure.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0186', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Long for my Saviour I’ve been waiting,\",\"Long time have watched by night and day;\",\"Feared, lest my faith and hope abating,\",\"I should lose courage by the way.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0186', 'chorus', 0, 1, '[\"Jesus soon is coming;\",\"This is my song —\",\"Cheers the heart when joys depart,\",\"And foes are pressing strong.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0186', 'verse', 2, 2, '[\"Here in this vale of sin and sorrow\",\"I have been wandering many years,\",\"Still looking for that happy morrow\",\"When God would wipe away my tears.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0186', 'verse', 3, 3, '[\"Oftimes the tempter comes in power,\",\"Fain then would lead my steps astray;\",\"But when the clouds begin to lower,\",\"Hope turns the darkness into day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0186', 'verse', 4, 4, '[\"O it will be but little longer\",\"I must these many woes endure;\",\"Then let my faith and hope grow stronger;\",\"My Father\'s promise still is sure.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0187', 187, 'The Lord Is Coming', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Lord is coming! let this be
The herald note of jubilee;
And when we meet, and when we part
The salutation from the heart.
The Lord is coming! sound it forth,');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0187', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"The Lord is coming! let this be\",\"The herald note of jubilee;\",\"And when we meet, and when we part\",\"The salutation from the heart.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0187', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"The Lord is coming! sound it forth,\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0188', 188, 'Star of Our Hope', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Star of our hope! He\'ll soon appear,
The last loud trumpet speaks Him near;
Hail Him, all saints, from pole to pole —
How welcome to the faithful soul!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0188', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Star of our hope! He\'ll soon appear,\",\"The last loud trumpet speaks Him near;\",\"Hail Him, all saints, from pole to pole —\",\"How welcome to the faithful soul!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0189', 189, 'Joy to the World', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Joy to the world, the Lord is come!
Let earth receive her King;
Let every heart prepare Him room,
And heaven and nature sing,
And heaven and nature sing,
And heaven, and heaven and nature sing.
Joy to the earth, the Savior reigns!
Let men their songs employ;
While fields and floods, rocks, hills, and plains,
Repeat the sounding joy,
Repeat the sounding joy,
Repeat, repeat the sounding joy.
No more let sin and sorrow grow,
Nor thorns infest the ground;
He comes to make His blessings flow
Far as the curse is found,
Far as the curse is found,
Far as, far as the curse is found.
Soohn will He rules the earth with grace,
And makes the nations prove
The glories of His righteousness,
And wonders of His love,
And wonders of His love,
And wonders, and wonders of His love.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0189', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Joy to the world, the Lord is come!\",\"Let earth receive her King;\",\"Let every heart prepare Him room,\",\"And heaven and nature sing,\",\"And heaven and nature sing,\",\"And heaven, and heaven and nature sing.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0189', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Joy to the earth, the Savior reigns!\",\"Let men their songs employ;\",\"While fields and floods, rocks, hills, and plains,\",\"Repeat the sounding joy,\",\"Repeat the sounding joy,\",\"Repeat, repeat the sounding joy.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0189', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"No more let sin and sorrow grow,\",\"Nor thorns infest the ground;\",\"He comes to make His blessings flow\",\"Far as the curse is found,\",\"Far as the curse is found,\",\"Far as, far as the curse is found.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0189', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Soohn will He rules the earth with grace,\",\"And makes the nations prove\",\"The glories of His righteousness,\",\"And wonders of His love,\",\"And wonders of His love,\",\"And wonders, and wonders of His love.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0190', 190, 'When Thou, My Righteous Judge', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'When Thou, my righteous Judge, shalt come,
To call Thy ransomed people home,
Shall I among them stand?
Shall such a worthless worm as I,
Who sometimes am afraid to die,
Be found at Thy right hand?
Be found at Thy right hand?
I love to meet among them now,
Before Thy gracious throne to bow,
Though weakest of them all;
Nor can I bear the piercing thought,
To have my worthless name left out,
When Thou for them shalt call,
When Thou for them shalt call.
Prevent, prevent it by Thy grace!
Be Thou, dear Lord, my hiding place
In that expected day.
Thy pardoning voice, O let me hear,
To still each unbelieving fear,
Nor let me fall, I pray,
Nor let me fall, I pray.
Let me among Thy saints be found,
Whene\'er the Archangel\'s trump shall sound,
To see Thy smiling face;
Then joyfully Thy praise I\'ll sing,
While heaven\'s resounding mansions ring
With shouts of endless grace,
With shouts of endless grace.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0190', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"When Thou, my righteous Judge, shalt come,\",\"To call Thy ransomed people home,\",\"Shall I among them stand?\",\"Shall such a worthless worm as I,\",\"Who sometimes am afraid to die,\",\"Be found at Thy right hand?\",\"Be found at Thy right hand?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0190', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"I love to meet among them now,\",\"Before Thy gracious throne to bow,\",\"Though weakest of them all;\",\"Nor can I bear the piercing thought,\",\"To have my worthless name left out,\",\"When Thou for them shalt call,\",\"When Thou for them shalt call.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0190', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Prevent, prevent it by Thy grace!\",\"Be Thou, dear Lord, my hiding place\",\"In that expected day.\",\"Thy pardoning voice, O let me hear,\",\"To still each unbelieving fear,\",\"Nor let me fall, I pray,\",\"Nor let me fall, I pray.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0190', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Let me among Thy saints be found,\",\"Whene\'er the Archangel\'s trump shall sound,\",\"To see Thy smiling face;\",\"Then joyfully Thy praise I\'ll sing,\",\"While heaven\'s resounding mansions ring\",\"With shouts of endless grace,\",\"With shouts of endless grace.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0191', 191, 'He’s Coming Once Again', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'He\'s coming once again,
To set His people free;
That where He is, in glory bright,
His saints may also be.
Then lift the drooping head,
Look up, rejoice and sing;
He comes, in majesty sublime,
Salvation\'s glorious King!
The earth shall quake with fear,
The heavens shall flee away;
And where shall guilty man appear
In that tremendous day?
No refuge then is nigh,
No shelter from the blast;
The night of vengeance veils the sky
When mercy\'s day is past.
His eyes of living flame
The wicked shall devour;
No tongue will lightly speak the name
Of Jesus in that hour.
No scorn, no words of hate
For His meek followers then;
But prayers and tears that come too late
Will mark earth\'s mighty men.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0191', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"He\'s coming once again,\",\"To set His people free;\",\"That where He is, in glory bright,\",\"His saints may also be.\",\"Then lift the drooping head,\",\"Look up, rejoice and sing;\",\"He comes, in majesty sublime,\",\"Salvation\'s glorious King!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0191', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"The earth shall quake with fear,\",\"The heavens shall flee away;\",\"And where shall guilty man appear\",\"In that tremendous day?\",\"No refuge then is nigh,\",\"No shelter from the blast;\",\"The night of vengeance veils the sky\",\"When mercy\'s day is past.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0191', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"His eyes of living flame\",\"The wicked shall devour;\",\"No tongue will lightly speak the name\",\"Of Jesus in that hour.\",\"No scorn, no words of hate\",\"For His meek followers then;\",\"But prayers and tears that come too late\",\"Will mark earth\'s mighty men.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0192', 192, 'Hark! That Shout', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hark! that shout of rapture high,
Bursting forth from yonder cloud;
Jesus comes, and, through the sky,
Angels tell their joy aloud,
Angels tell their joy aloud.
Hark! the trumpet\'s awful voice
Sounds abroad o\'er sea and land;
Let His people now rejoice;
Their redemption is at hand,
Their redemption is at hand.
See, the Lord appears in view;
Heaven and earth before Him fly;
Rise, ye saints, He comes for you;
Rise, to meet Him in the sky,
Rise, to meet Him in the sky.
Go and dwell with Him above,
Where no foe can e\'er molest;
Happy in the Saviour\'s love,
Ever blessing, ever blest,
Ever blessing, ever blest.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0192', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Hark! that shout of rapture high,\",\"Bursting forth from yonder cloud;\",\"Jesus comes, and, through the sky,\",\"Angels tell their joy aloud,\",\"Angels tell their joy aloud.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0192', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Hark! the trumpet\'s awful voice\",\"Sounds abroad o\'er sea and land;\",\"Let His people now rejoice;\",\"Their redemption is at hand,\",\"Their redemption is at hand.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0192', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"See, the Lord appears in view;\",\"Heaven and earth before Him fly;\",\"Rise, ye saints, He comes for you;\",\"Rise, to meet Him in the sky,\",\"Rise, to meet Him in the sky.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0192', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Go and dwell with Him above,\",\"Where no foe can e\'er molest;\",\"Happy in the Saviour\'s love,\",\"Ever blessing, ever blest,\",\"Ever blessing, ever blest.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0193', 193, 'Thy Kingdom Come', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thy kingdom come! on bended knee
The passing ages pray;
And faithful souls have yearned to see
On earth that kingdom\'s day.
But the slow watches of the night
Not less to God belong;
And for the everlasting right
The silent stars are strong.
And lo, already on the hills
The flags of dawn appear;
Gird up your loins, ye prophet souls,
Proclaim the day is near.
The day in whose clear-shining light
All wrong shall stand revealed,
When justice shall be throned in might,
And every hurt be healed.
When knowledge, hand in hand with peace,
Shall walk the earth abroad;
The day of perfect righteousness,
The promised day of God.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0193', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Thy kingdom come! on bended knee\",\"The passing ages pray;\",\"And faithful souls have yearned to see\",\"On earth that kingdom\'s day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0193', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"But the slow watches of the night\",\"Not less to God belong;\",\"And for the everlasting right\",\"The silent stars are strong.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0193', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"And lo, already on the hills\",\"The flags of dawn appear;\",\"Gird up your loins, ye prophet souls,\",\"Proclaim the day is near.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0193', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"The day in whose clear-shining light\",\"All wrong shall stand revealed,\",\"When justice shall be throned in might,\",\"And every hurt be healed.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0193', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"When knowledge, hand in hand with peace,\",\"Shall walk the earth abroad;\",\"The day of perfect righteousness,\",\"The promised day of God.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0194', 194, 'The King Shall Come', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The King shall come when morning dawns
And light triumphant breaks;
When beauty gilds the eastern hills,
And life to joy awakes.
Not as of old a little child
To bear and fight and die,
But crowned with glory like the sun
That lights the morning sky.
O, brighter than the rising morn
When He, victorious, rose
And left the lonesome place of death,
Despite the rage of foes.
O, brighter than that glorious morn
Shall this fair morning be,
When Christ, our King, in beauty comes,
And we His face shall see.
The King shall come when morning dawns
And earth\'s dark night is past:
O haste the rising of that morn,
The day that aye shall last.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0194', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"The King shall come when morning dawns\",\"And light triumphant breaks;\",\"When beauty gilds the eastern hills,\",\"And life to joy awakes.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0194', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Not as of old a little child\",\"To bear and fight and die,\",\"But crowned with glory like the sun\",\"That lights the morning sky.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0194', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"O, brighter than the rising morn\",\"When He, victorious, rose\",\"And left the lonesome place of death,\",\"Despite the rage of foes.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0194', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"O, brighter than that glorious morn\",\"Shall this fair morning be,\",\"When Christ, our King, in beauty comes,\",\"And we His face shall see.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0194', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"The King shall come when morning dawns\",\"And earth\'s dark night is past:\",\"O haste the rising of that morn,\",\"The day that aye shall last.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0195', 195, 'Great God, What Do I See', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Great God, what do I see and hear!
The end of things created!
The Judge of man I see appear
On clouds of glory seated;
The trumpet sounds; the graves restore
The dead which they contained before;
Prepare, my soul, to meet Him.
The dead in Christ shall first arise,
At the last trumpet\'s sounding —
Caught up to meet Him in the skies,
With joy their Lord surrounding;
No gloomy fears their souls dismay,
His presence sheds eternal day
On those prepared to meet Him.
But sinners filled with guilty fears,
Behold His wrath prevailing;
For they shall rise, and find their tears
And sighs are unavailing;
The day of grace is past and gone
Trembling they stand before the throne,
All unprepared to meet Him.
Great God! what di I see and hear!
The end of things created!
The Judge of man I see apprear
On clouds of glory seated;
Beneath His cross I view the day
When heaven and earth shall pass away,
And thus prepare to meet Him.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0195', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Great God, what do I see and hear!\",\"The end of things created!\",\"The Judge of man I see appear\",\"On clouds of glory seated;\",\"The trumpet sounds; the graves restore\",\"The dead which they contained before;\",\"Prepare, my soul, to meet Him.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0195', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"The dead in Christ shall first arise,\",\"At the last trumpet\'s sounding —\",\"Caught up to meet Him in the skies,\",\"With joy their Lord surrounding;\",\"No gloomy fears their souls dismay,\",\"His presence sheds eternal day\",\"On those prepared to meet Him.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0195', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"But sinners filled with guilty fears,\",\"Behold His wrath prevailing;\",\"For they shall rise, and find their tears\",\"And sighs are unavailing;\",\"The day of grace is past and gone\",\"Trembling they stand before the throne,\",\"All unprepared to meet Him.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0195', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Great God! what di I see and hear!\",\"The end of things created!\",\"The Judge of man I see apprear\",\"On clouds of glory seated;\",\"Beneath His cross I view the day\",\"When heaven and earth shall pass away,\",\"And thus prepare to meet Him.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0196', 196, 'Thou Art Coming, O My Saviour', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thou art coming, O my Saviour,
Thou art coming, O my King,
In Thy beauty all resplendent,
In Thy glory all transcendent;
Well may we rejoice and sing:
Coming! in the opening east
Herald brightness slowly swells;
Coming! O my glorious Priest,
Hear we not Thy golden bells?
Thou art coming, Thou art coming;
We shall meet Thee on Thy way,
We shall see Thee, we shall know Thee,
We shall bless Thee, We shall show Thee
All our hearts could never say;
What an anthem that will be,
Ringing out our love to Thee,
Pouring out our rapture sweet
At Thine own allglorious feet.
Thou art coming; we are waiting
With a hope that cannot fail,
Asking not the day or hour,
Resting on Thy word of power,
Anchored safe within the veil.
Time appointed may be long,
But the vision must be sure;
Certainly must make us strong,
Joyful patience can endure.
O the joy to see Thee reigning,
Thee, our own beloved Lord!
Every tongue Thy name, confessing,
Worship, honor, glory, blessing
Brought to Thee with one accord;
Thee, our Master and our Friend,
Vindicated and enthroned,
Unto earth\'s remotest end
Glorified, adored, and owned.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0196', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Thou art coming, O my Saviour,\",\"Thou art coming, O my King,\",\"In Thy beauty all resplendent,\",\"In Thy glory all transcendent;\",\"Well may we rejoice and sing:\",\"Coming! in the opening east\",\"Herald brightness slowly swells;\",\"Coming! O my glorious Priest,\",\"Hear we not Thy golden bells?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0196', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Thou art coming, Thou art coming;\",\"We shall meet Thee on Thy way,\",\"We shall see Thee, we shall know Thee,\",\"We shall bless Thee, We shall show Thee\",\"All our hearts could never say;\",\"What an anthem that will be,\",\"Ringing out our love to Thee,\",\"Pouring out our rapture sweet\",\"At Thine own allglorious feet.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0196', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Thou art coming; we are waiting\",\"With a hope that cannot fail,\",\"Asking not the day or hour,\",\"Resting on Thy word of power,\",\"Anchored safe within the veil.\",\"Time appointed may be long,\",\"But the vision must be sure;\",\"Certainly must make us strong,\",\"Joyful patience can endure.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0196', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"O the joy to see Thee reigning,\",\"Thee, our own beloved Lord!\",\"Every tongue Thy name, confessing,\",\"Worship, honor, glory, blessing\",\"Brought to Thee with one accord;\",\"Thee, our Master and our Friend,\",\"Vindicated and enthroned,\",\"Unto earth\'s remotest end\",\"Glorified, adored, and owned.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0197', 197, 'Wake, Awake, For Night Is Flying', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wake, awake, for night is flying,
The watchmen on the heights are crying,
Awake, Jerusalem, arise!
Midnight\'s solemn hour is tolling,
His chariot wheels are nearer rolling,
He comes; prepare, ye virgins wise.
Rise up with willing feet
Go forth, the Bridegroom meet;
Alleluia!
Bear through the night your well-trimmed light,
Speed forth to join the marriage rite.
Zion hears the watchmen singing,
Her heart with deep delight is springing,
She wakes, she rises from her gloom;
Forth her Bridegroom comes, all-glorious,
In grace arrayed, by truth victorious;
Her Star is risen, her Light is come!
All hail, incarnate Lord,
Our crown, and our reward!
Alleluia!
We haste along, in pomp and song,
And gladsome join the marriage throng.
Lamb of God, the heavens adore Thee,
And men and angels sing before Thee,
With harp and cymbal\'s clearest tone.
By the pearly gates in wonder
We stand, and swell the voice of thunder,
That echoes round Thy dazzling throne.
No vision ever brought,
No ear hath ever caught,
Such bliss and joy;
We raise the song, we swell the throng,
To praise Thee ages all along.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0197', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Wake, awake, for night is flying,\",\"The watchmen on the heights are crying,\",\"Awake, Jerusalem, arise!\",\"Midnight\'s solemn hour is tolling,\",\"His chariot wheels are nearer rolling,\",\"He comes; prepare, ye virgins wise.\",\"Rise up with willing feet\",\"Go forth, the Bridegroom meet;\",\"Alleluia!\",\"Bear through the night your well-trimmed light,\",\"Speed forth to join the marriage rite.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0197', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Zion hears the watchmen singing,\",\"Her heart with deep delight is springing,\",\"She wakes, she rises from her gloom;\",\"Forth her Bridegroom comes, all-glorious,\",\"In grace arrayed, by truth victorious;\",\"Her Star is risen, her Light is come!\",\"All hail, incarnate Lord,\",\"Our crown, and our reward!\",\"Alleluia!\",\"We haste along, in pomp and song,\",\"And gladsome join the marriage throng.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0197', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Lamb of God, the heavens adore Thee,\",\"And men and angels sing before Thee,\",\"With harp and cymbal\'s clearest tone.\",\"By the pearly gates in wonder\",\"We stand, and swell the voice of thunder,\",\"That echoes round Thy dazzling throne.\",\"No vision ever brought,\",\"No ear hath ever caught,\",\"Such bliss and joy;\",\"We raise the song, we swell the throng,\",\"To praise Thee ages all along.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0198', 198, 'O Lord of Life', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'O lord of life, Thy kingdom is at hand,
Blest reign of love and liberty and light;
Time long foretold by seers of every land;
The cherished dream of watchers through the night.
Lo! in our hearts shines forth the morning star,
Shedding its luster on our darkened way;
And we behold, as pilgrims from afar,
The holy dawning of Thy perfect day.
Now gleams at last upon our waiting eyes
The glory of the kingdom that shall be;
When truth in conquering grandeur shall arise,
And Christ shall rule the world with equity.
Forward again we move at Thy command!
The flaming pillar leading on anew;
One in the faith of all Thy prophet band,
Onward we press to make the vision true.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0198', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"O lord of life, Thy kingdom is at hand,\",\"Blest reign of love and liberty and light;\",\"Time long foretold by seers of every land;\",\"The cherished dream of watchers through the night.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0198', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Lo! in our hearts shines forth the morning star,\",\"Shedding its luster on our darkened way;\",\"And we behold, as pilgrims from afar,\",\"The holy dawning of Thy perfect day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0198', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Now gleams at last upon our waiting eyes\",\"The glory of the kingdom that shall be;\",\"When truth in conquering grandeur shall arise,\",\"And Christ shall rule the world with equity.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0198', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Forward again we move at Thy command!\",\"The flaming pillar leading on anew;\",\"One in the faith of all Thy prophet band,\",\"Onward we press to make the vision true.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0199', 199, 'We Speak of the Realms', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We speak of the realms of the blest,
That country so bright and so fair,
And oft are its glories confessed —
But what must it be to be there!
We speak of its pathway of gold —
Its walls decked with jewels so rare,
Its wonders and pleasures untold —
But what must it be to be there!
We speak of its freedom of sin,');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0199', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"We speak of the realms of the blest,\",\"That country so bright and so fair,\",\"And oft are its glories confessed —\",\"But what must it be to be there!\",\"We speak of its pathway of gold —\",\"Its walls decked with jewels so rare,\",\"Its wonders and pleasures untold —\",\"But what must it be to be there!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0199', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"We speak of its freedom of sin,\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0200', 200, 'I Long to Behold Him', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I long to behold Him arrayed
With glory and light from above;
The King in His beauty displayed,
His beauty of holiest love:
I languish, and sigh to be there,
Where Jesus hath fixed His abode;
O, when shall we meet in the air,
And fly to the mountain of God?
With Him, I on Zion shall stand,
For Jesus has spoken the word;
The breath of Immanuel\'s land,
Survey, by the side of my Lord!
But when, on Thy bosom reclined,
Thy face I am strengthened to see,
My fullness of rapture I find,
My heaven of heavens, in Thee.
How happy the people whose home
Is found in the city of God!
As pilgrims no more they shall roam,
Nor travel a dangerous road.
Physician divine, unto me
Thy soul-healing blessing now give,
And keep me while waiting for Thee,
And then to that city receive.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0200', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"I long to behold Him arrayed\",\"With glory and light from above;\",\"The King in His beauty displayed,\",\"His beauty of holiest love:\",\"I languish, and sigh to be there,\",\"Where Jesus hath fixed His abode;\",\"O, when shall we meet in the air,\",\"And fly to the mountain of God?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0200', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"With Him, I on Zion shall stand,\",\"For Jesus has spoken the word;\",\"The breath of Immanuel\'s land,\",\"Survey, by the side of my Lord!\",\"But when, on Thy bosom reclined,\",\"Thy face I am strengthened to see,\",\"My fullness of rapture I find,\",\"My heaven of heavens, in Thee.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0200', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"How happy the people whose home\",\"Is found in the city of God!\",\"As pilgrims no more they shall roam,\",\"Nor travel a dangerous road.\",\"Physician divine, unto me\",\"Thy soul-healing blessing now give,\",\"And keep me while waiting for Thee,\",\"And then to that city receive.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0201', 201, 'Soon May the Last Glad Song Arise', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Soon may the last glad song arise
Through all the millions of the skies;
That song of triumph which records
That all the earth is now the Lord’s.
Let thrones and powers and kingdoms be
Obedient, mighty God, to Thee;
And over land and stream and main
Wave Thou the scepter of Thy reign.
O let the anthem now might swell,
And host to host the triumph tell,
Till not one rebel heart remains,
But over all the Savior reigns!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0201', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Soon may the last glad song arise\",\"Through all the millions of the skies;\",\"That song of triumph which records\",\"That all the earth is now the Lord’s.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0201', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Let thrones and powers and kingdoms be\",\"Obedient, mighty God, to Thee;\",\"And over land and stream and main\",\"Wave Thou the scepter of Thy reign.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0201', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"O let the anthem now might swell,\",\"And host to host the triumph tell,\",\"Till not one rebel heart remains,\",\"But over all the Savior reigns!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0202', 202, 'O What Their Joy Must Be', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'O what their joy and their glory must be,
Those endless sabbaths the blessed ones see;
Crown for the valiant, to weary ones rest;
God shall be all, and in all ever blest.
Truly, \"Jerusalem\" name we that shore,
\"Vision of peace,\" that brings joy evermore;
Wish and fulfillment can severed be ne\'er,
Nor the thing prayed for come short of the prayer.
We, where no trouble distraction can bring,
safely the anthems of Zion shall sing;
While for thy grace, Lord, their voices of praise
Thy blessed people shall evermore raise.
Now, in the meanwhile, with hearts raised on high,
We for that country must yearn and must sigh;
Seeking Jerusalem, dear native land,
Through our long exile on Babylon\'s strand.
Low before him with our praises we fall,
Of whom, and in whom, and through whom are all;
Of whom, the Father; and in whom, the Son;
Through whom, the Spirit, with these ever One.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0202', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"O what their joy and their glory must be,\",\"Those endless sabbaths the blessed ones see;\",\"Crown for the valiant, to weary ones rest;\",\"God shall be all, and in all ever blest.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0202', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Truly, \\\"Jerusalem\\\" name we that shore,\",\"\\\"Vision of peace,\\\" that brings joy evermore;\",\"Wish and fulfillment can severed be ne\'er,\",\"Nor the thing prayed for come short of the prayer.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0202', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"We, where no trouble distraction can bring,\",\"safely the anthems of Zion shall sing;\",\"While for thy grace, Lord, their voices of praise\",\"Thy blessed people shall evermore raise.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0202', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Now, in the meanwhile, with hearts raised on high,\",\"We for that country must yearn and must sigh;\",\"Seeking Jerusalem, dear native land,\",\"Through our long exile on Babylon\'s strand.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0202', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Low before him with our praises we fall,\",\"Of whom, and in whom, and through whom are all;\",\"Of whom, the Father; and in whom, the Son;\",\"Through whom, the Spirit, with these ever One.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0203', 203, 'The Word Can Make Me Whole', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Word, whose word can make me whole,
Has heard my spirit\'s cry,
And in the palace of the soul,
He dwells! my Lord and I!
How holy must the temple be,
Where Jesus reigns within!
His precious blood, outpoured for me,
I trust to make me clean.
And he is come! To whom the praise,
The joy of heaven, belong;
My face I veil, my hands I raise,
And \"silence is my song.\"
And now to me the gladdest thing
Be his sweet will alone;
Content, since I am with the King,
To make his choice my own.
He makes his palace in my soul,
He brings my spirit nigh;
Within my heart, \'neath his control
I dwell — my Lord and I!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0203', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"The Word, whose word can make me whole,\",\"Has heard my spirit\'s cry,\",\"And in the palace of the soul,\",\"He dwells! my Lord and I!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0203', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"How holy must the temple be,\",\"Where Jesus reigns within!\",\"His precious blood, outpoured for me,\",\"I trust to make me clean.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0203', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"And he is come! To whom the praise,\",\"The joy of heaven, belong;\",\"My face I veil, my hands I raise,\",\"And \\\"silence is my song.\\\"\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0203', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"And now to me the gladdest thing\",\"Be his sweet will alone;\",\"Content, since I am with the King,\",\"To make his choice my own.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0203', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"He makes his palace in my soul,\",\"He brings my spirit nigh;\",\"Within my heart, \'neath his control\",\"I dwell — my Lord and I!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0204', 204, 'Come, Gracious Spirit', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, gracious Spirit, heav\'nly Dove,
With light and comfort from above;
Be Thou our Guardian, Thou our Guide;
O\'er all thoughts and step preside.
To us the light of truth display,
And make us know and choose thy way;
Plant holy fear in every heart,
That we from God may ne\'er depart.
Lead us to holiness — the road
That we must take to dwell with God;
Lead us to Christ, the living way,
Nor let us from his precepts stray.
Lead us to God, our final rest,
To be with him forever blest;
Lead us to heaven, its bliss to share
Fullness of joy forever there!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0204', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Come, gracious Spirit, heav\'nly Dove,\",\"With light and comfort from above;\",\"Be Thou our Guardian, Thou our Guide;\",\"O\'er all thoughts and step preside.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0204', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"To us the light of truth display,\",\"And make us know and choose thy way;\",\"Plant holy fear in every heart,\",\"That we from God may ne\'er depart.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0204', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Lead us to holiness — the road\",\"That we must take to dwell with God;\",\"Lead us to Christ, the living way,\",\"Nor let us from his precepts stray.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0204', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Lead us to God, our final rest,\",\"To be with him forever blest;\",\"Lead us to heaven, its bliss to share\",\"Fullness of joy forever there!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0205', 205, 'Come, Holy Spirit, Come', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, Holy Spirit, come,
Let thy bright beams arise,
Dispel the sorrow from our minds,
The darkness from our eyes.
Convince us all of sin,
Then lead to Jesus’ blood,
And to our wondering view reveal
The mercies of our God.
Revive our drooping faith,
Our doubts and fears remove,
And kindle in our breasts the flame
Of never dying love.
’Tis Thine to cleanse the heart,
To sanctify the soul,
To pour fresh life in every part,
And new create the whole.
Come, Holy Spirit, come,
Our minds from bondage free;
Then we shall know, and praise, and love,
The Father, Son, and Thee.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0205', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Come, Holy Spirit, come,\",\"Let thy bright beams arise,\",\"Dispel the sorrow from our minds,\",\"The darkness from our eyes.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0205', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Convince us all of sin,\",\"Then lead to Jesus’ blood,\",\"And to our wondering view reveal\",\"The mercies of our God.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0205', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Revive our drooping faith,\",\"Our doubts and fears remove,\",\"And kindle in our breasts the flame\",\"Of never dying love.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0205', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"’Tis Thine to cleanse the heart,\",\"To sanctify the soul,\",\"To pour fresh life in every part,\",\"And new create the whole.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0205', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Come, Holy Spirit, come,\",\"Our minds from bondage free;\",\"Then we shall know, and praise, and love,\",\"The Father, Son, and Thee.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0206', 206, 'Holy Spirit, Light Divine', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Holy Spirit, light divine,
Shine upon this heart of mine,
Chase the shade of night away,
Turn my darkness into day.
Holy Spirit, power divine,
Cleanse this guilty heart of mine;
Long has sin, without control,
Held dominion o’er my soul.
Holy Ghost, with joy divine,
Cheer this saddened heart of mine,
Bid my many woes depart,
Heal my wounded, bleeding heart.
Holy Spirit, all divine,
Dwell within this heart of mine,
Cast down every idol throne,
Reign supreme, and reign alone.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0206', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Holy Spirit, light divine,\",\"Shine upon this heart of mine,\",\"Chase the shade of night away,\",\"Turn my darkness into day.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0206', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Holy Spirit, power divine,\",\"Cleanse this guilty heart of mine;\",\"Long has sin, without control,\",\"Held dominion o’er my soul.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0206', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Holy Ghost, with joy divine,\",\"Cheer this saddened heart of mine,\",\"Bid my many woes depart,\",\"Heal my wounded, bleeding heart.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0206', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Holy Spirit, all divine,\",\"Dwell within this heart of mine,\",\"Cast down every idol throne,\",\"Reign supreme, and reign alone.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0207', 207, 'Let Thy Spirit, Blessed Saviour', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Let thy Spirit, blessed Saviour,
Come and bid our doubtings cease;
Come, O, come with love and favor,
Fill us all with joy and peace.
Fearful dangers are around us,
Satan watches to destroy;
Lord, our foes would fain confound us;
O, for us thy might employ!
On thy word our souls are resting;
Taught by thee, thy name we love;
Sweetest of all names is Jesus;
How it doth our spirits move!
Let us not, O Lord, be weary
Of the roughness of the way;
Though the road be often dreary,
Thou shalt drive our gloom away.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0207', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Let thy Spirit, blessed Saviour,\",\"Come and bid our doubtings cease;\",\"Come, O, come with love and favor,\",\"Fill us all with joy and peace.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0207', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Fearful dangers are around us,\",\"Satan watches to destroy;\",\"Lord, our foes would fain confound us;\",\"O, for us thy might employ!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0207', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"On thy word our souls are resting;\",\"Taught by thee, thy name we love;\",\"Sweetest of all names is Jesus;\",\"How it doth our spirits move!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0207', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Let us not, O Lord, be weary\",\"Of the roughness of the way;\",\"Though the road be often dreary,\",\"Thou shalt drive our gloom away.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0208', 208, 'Lord, I Hear of Showers of Blessing', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lord, I hear of showers of blessing,
Thou art scattering full and free;
Showers, the thirsty soul refreshing;
Let some drops now fall on me,
Even me, even me,
Let some drops now fall on me.
Pass me not, O gracious Father!
Sinful though my heart may be;
Thou might\'st leave me, but the rather
Let thy mercy rest on me.
Even me, even me,
Let some drops now fall on me.
Have I long in sin been sleeping?
Long been slighting, grieving, thee?
Has the world my heart been keeping?
O forgive and rescue me!
Even me, even me,
Let some drops now fall on me.
Pass me not, O Holy Spirit!
Thou canst make the blind to see;
Testify of Jesus\' merit,
Speak the word of peace to me.
Even me, even me,
Let some drops now fall on me.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0208', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Lord, I hear of showers of blessing,\",\"Thou art scattering full and free;\",\"Showers, the thirsty soul refreshing;\",\"Let some drops now fall on me,\",\"Even me, even me,\",\"Let some drops now fall on me.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0208', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Pass me not, O gracious Father!\",\"Sinful though my heart may be;\",\"Thou might\'st leave me, but the rather\",\"Let thy mercy rest on me.\",\"Even me, even me,\",\"Let some drops now fall on me.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0208', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Have I long in sin been sleeping?\",\"Long been slighting, grieving, thee?\",\"Has the world my heart been keeping?\",\"O forgive and rescue me!\",\"Even me, even me,\",\"Let some drops now fall on me.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0208', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Pass me not, O Holy Spirit!\",\"Thou canst make the blind to see;\",\"Testify of Jesus\' merit,\",\"Speak the word of peace to me.\",\"Even me, even me,\",\"Let some drops now fall on me.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0209', 209, 'Come, Holy Spirit', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove,
With all thy quickening powers;
Kindle a flame of sacred love
In these cold hearts of ours.
O raise our thoughts from things below,');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0209', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Come, Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove,\",\"With all thy quickening powers;\",\"Kindle a flame of sacred love\",\"In these cold hearts of ours.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0209', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"O raise our thoughts from things below,\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0210', 210, 'O For That Flame of Living Fire', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'O for that flame of living fire
Which shone so bright in saints of old;
Which bade their souls to heaven aspire,
Calm in distress, in danger bold!
Where is that spirit, Lord, which dwelt
In Abram’s breast, and sealed him thine?
Which made Paul’s heart with sorrow melt,
And glow with energy divine?
That spirit which from age to age
Proclaimed thy love, and taught thy ways?
Brightened Isaiah’s vivid page,
And breathed in David’s hallowed lays?
Is not thy grace as mighty now
As when Elijah felt its power?
When glory beamed from Moses’ brow,
Or Job endured the trying hour?
Remember, Lord, the ancient days;
Renew thy work, thy grace restore;
And while to thee our hearts we raise,
On us thy Holy Spirit pour.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0210', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"O for that flame of living fire\",\"Which shone so bright in saints of old;\",\"Which bade their souls to heaven aspire,\",\"Calm in distress, in danger bold!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0210', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Where is that spirit, Lord, which dwelt\",\"In Abram’s breast, and sealed him thine?\",\"Which made Paul’s heart with sorrow melt,\",\"And glow with energy divine?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0210', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"That spirit which from age to age\",\"Proclaimed thy love, and taught thy ways?\",\"Brightened Isaiah’s vivid page,\",\"And breathed in David’s hallowed lays?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0210', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Is not thy grace as mighty now\",\"As when Elijah felt its power?\",\"When glory beamed from Moses’ brow,\",\"Or Job endured the trying hour?\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0210', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Remember, Lord, the ancient days;\",\"Renew thy work, thy grace restore;\",\"And while to thee our hearts we raise,\",\"On us thy Holy Spirit pour.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0211', 211, 'Holy Spirit, Faithful Guide', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Holy Spirit, faithful Guide,
Ever near the Christian’s side,
Gently lead us by the hand
Pilgrims in a desert land;
Weary souls fore’er rejoice,
While they hear that sweetest voice,
Whispering softly, “Wand’rer, come!
Follow me, I’ll guide thee home.”
Ever present, truest Friend,
Ever near Thine aid to lend,
Leave us not to doubt and fear,
Groping on in darkness drear;
When the storms are raging sore,
Hearts grow faint, and hopes give o’er —
Whisper softly, “Wanderer, come!
Follow me, I’ll guide thee home.”
When our days of toil shall cease,
Waiting still for sweet release,
Nothing left but heaven and prayer,
Wondering if our names were there;
Wading deep the dismal flood,
Pleading naught but Jesus’ blood,
Whisper softly, “Wanderer, come!
Follow me, I’ll guide thee home.”');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0211', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Holy Spirit, faithful Guide,\",\"Ever near the Christian’s side,\",\"Gently lead us by the hand\",\"Pilgrims in a desert land;\",\"Weary souls fore’er rejoice,\",\"While they hear that sweetest voice,\",\"Whispering softly, “Wand’rer, come!\",\"Follow me, I’ll guide thee home.”\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0211', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Ever present, truest Friend,\",\"Ever near Thine aid to lend,\",\"Leave us not to doubt and fear,\",\"Groping on in darkness drear;\",\"When the storms are raging sore,\",\"Hearts grow faint, and hopes give o’er —\",\"Whisper softly, “Wanderer, come!\",\"Follow me, I’ll guide thee home.”\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0211', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"When our days of toil shall cease,\",\"Waiting still for sweet release,\",\"Nothing left but heaven and prayer,\",\"Wondering if our names were there;\",\"Wading deep the dismal flood,\",\"Pleading naught but Jesus’ blood,\",\"Whisper softly, “Wanderer, come!\",\"Follow me, I’ll guide thee home.”\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0212', 212, 'Hover O\'er Me, Holy Spirit', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hover o\'er me, Holy Spirit,
Bathe my trembling heart and brow;
Fill me with thy hallowed presence,
Come, O come and fill me now.
Fill me now, fill me now,
Jesus, come and fill me now.
Fill me with thy hallowed presence,
Come, O come and fill me now.
Thou canst fill me, gracious Spirit,
Though I cannot tell thee how;
But I need thee, greatly need thee;
Come, O come and fill me now.
I am weakness, full of weakness;
At thy sacred feet I bow;
Blest, divine, eternal Spirit,
Fill with love, and fill me now.
Cleanse and comfort, bless and save me;
Bathe, O, bathe my heart and brow;
Thou art comforting and saving,
Thou art sweetly filling now.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0212', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Hover o\'er me, Holy Spirit,\",\"Bathe my trembling heart and brow;\",\"Fill me with thy hallowed presence,\",\"Come, O come and fill me now.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0212', 'chorus', 0, 1, '[\"Fill me now, fill me now,\",\"Jesus, come and fill me now.\",\"Fill me with thy hallowed presence,\",\"Come, O come and fill me now.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0212', 'verse', 2, 2, '[\"Thou canst fill me, gracious Spirit,\",\"Though I cannot tell thee how;\",\"But I need thee, greatly need thee;\",\"Come, O come and fill me now.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0212', 'verse', 3, 3, '[\"I am weakness, full of weakness;\",\"At thy sacred feet I bow;\",\"Blest, divine, eternal Spirit,\",\"Fill with love, and fill me now.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0212', 'verse', 4, 4, '[\"Cleanse and comfort, bless and save me;\",\"Bathe, O, bathe my heart and brow;\",\"Thou art comforting and saving,\",\"Thou art sweetly filling now.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0213', 213, 'Spirit Divine', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Spirit divine, attend our prayers,
And make this house thy home;
Descend with all thy gracious powers;
Come Holy Spirit, come.
Come as the light! to us reveal
The truth we long to know,
Reveal the narrow path of right,
The way of duty show.
Come as the fire! and purge our hearts
Like sacrificial flame,
Till our whole souls an offering be
In love\'s redeeming name.
Come as the dew! and sweetly bless
This consecrated hour,
Till every barren place shall own
With joy thy quickening power.
Come as the wind, O breath of God!
O Pentecostal grace!
Come, make thy great salvation known
Wide as the human race.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0213', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Spirit divine, attend our prayers,\",\"And make this house thy home;\",\"Descend with all thy gracious powers;\",\"Come Holy Spirit, come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0213', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Come as the light! to us reveal\",\"The truth we long to know,\",\"Reveal the narrow path of right,\",\"The way of duty show.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0213', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Come as the fire! and purge our hearts\",\"Like sacrificial flame,\",\"Till our whole souls an offering be\",\"In love\'s redeeming name.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0213', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Come as the dew! and sweetly bless\",\"This consecrated hour,\",\"Till every barren place shall own\",\"With joy thy quickening power.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0213', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Come as the wind, O breath of God!\",\"O Pentecostal grace!\",\"Come, make thy great salvation known\",\"Wide as the human race.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0214', 214, 'Our Blest Redeemer', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Our blest Redeemer, ere he breathed
His tender last farewell,
A Guide, a Comforter, bequeathed
With us to dwell.
He came sweet influence to impart,
A gracious, willing Guest,
While he can find one humble heart
Wherein to rest.
And his that gentle voice we hear,
Soft as the breath of even,
That checks the wrong, that calms the fear,
And speaks of Heaven.
And every virtue we possess,
And every victory won,
And every thought of holiness
Are his alone.
Spirit of purity and grace,
Our weakness, pitying, see;
O make our hearts thy dwelling place,
Till all like thee.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0214', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Our blest Redeemer, ere he breathed\",\"His tender last farewell,\",\"A Guide, a Comforter, bequeathed\",\"With us to dwell.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0214', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"He came sweet influence to impart,\",\"A gracious, willing Guest,\",\"While he can find one humble heart\",\"Wherein to rest.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0214', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"And his that gentle voice we hear,\",\"Soft as the breath of even,\",\"That checks the wrong, that calms the fear,\",\"And speaks of Heaven.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0214', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"And every virtue we possess,\",\"And every victory won,\",\"And every thought of holiness\",\"Are his alone.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0214', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Spirit of purity and grace,\",\"Our weakness, pitying, see;\",\"O make our hearts thy dwelling place,\",\"Till all like thee.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0215', 215, 'Gracious Spirit, Love Divine', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gracious Spirit, Love divine,
Let thy light within me shine,
All my guilty fears remove,
Fill me with thy heavenly love.
Speak thy pardoning grace to me,
Set the burdened sinner free,
Lead me to the Lamb of God,
Wash me in his precious blood.
Life and peace to me impart,
Seal salvation on my heart,
Breathe thyself into my breast,
Earnest of immortal rest.
Let me never from thee stray,
Keep me in the narrow way,
Fill my soul with joy divine,
Keep me, Lord, forever thine.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0215', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Gracious Spirit, Love divine,\",\"Let thy light within me shine,\",\"All my guilty fears remove,\",\"Fill me with thy heavenly love.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0215', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Speak thy pardoning grace to me,\",\"Set the burdened sinner free,\",\"Lead me to the Lamb of God,\",\"Wash me in his precious blood.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0215', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Life and peace to me impart,\",\"Seal salvation on my heart,\",\"Breathe thyself into my breast,\",\"Earnest of immortal rest.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0215', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Let me never from thee stray,\",\"Keep me in the narrow way,\",\"Fill my soul with joy divine,\",\"Keep me, Lord, forever thine.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0216', 216, 'Holy Spirit, Lamp of Light', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Holy Spirit, lamp of light,
Shine upon our nature\'s night;
Give thy blessed inward sight,
Comforter divine!
We are sinful; cleanse us, Lord;
We are faint; thy strength afford;
Lost — until by thee restored,
Comforter divine!
Like the dew, thy peace distill;
Guide, subdue our wayward will,
Things of Christ unfolding still,
Comforter divine!
In us \"Abba, Father,\" cry —
Earnest of our rest on high,
Hope of immortality,
Comforter divine!
Search for us the depths of God;
Bear us up the starry road
To the height of thine abode,
Comforter divine!');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0216', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Holy Spirit, lamp of light,\",\"Shine upon our nature\'s night;\",\"Give thy blessed inward sight,\",\"Comforter divine!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0216', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"We are sinful; cleanse us, Lord;\",\"We are faint; thy strength afford;\",\"Lost — until by thee restored,\",\"Comforter divine!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0216', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Like the dew, thy peace distill;\",\"Guide, subdue our wayward will,\",\"Things of Christ unfolding still,\",\"Comforter divine!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0216', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"In us \\\"Abba, Father,\\\" cry —\",\"Earnest of our rest on high,\",\"Hope of immortality,\",\"Comforter divine!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0216', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Search for us the depths of God;\",\"Bear us up the starry road\",\"To the height of thine abode,\",\"Comforter divine!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0217', 217, 'O Word of God Incarnate', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'O Word of God incarnate,
O Wisdom from on high,
O Truth unchanged, unchanging,
O Light of our dark sky:
We praise thee for the radiance
That from the hallowed page,
A lantern to our footsteps,
Shines on from age to age.
The church from her dear Master
Received the gift divine,
And still that light is lifted
O\'er all the earth to shine.
It is the golden casket,
Where gems of truth are stored;
It is the heaven-drawn picture
Of Christ, the living Word.
It floateth like a banner
Before God\'s host unfurled;
It shines like a beacon
Above the darkling world.
It is the chart and compass
That o\'er life\'s surging sea,
\'Mid mists and rocks and quicksands,
Still guides, O Christ, to Thee.
O make thy church, dear Saviour,
A lamp of purest gold,
To bear before the nations
Thy true light as of old.
O teach thy wandering pilgrims
By this their path to trace,
Till, clouds and darkness ended,
They see thee face to face.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0217', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"O Word of God incarnate,\",\"O Wisdom from on high,\",\"O Truth unchanged, unchanging,\",\"O Light of our dark sky:\",\"We praise thee for the radiance\",\"That from the hallowed page,\",\"A lantern to our footsteps,\",\"Shines on from age to age.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0217', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"The church from her dear Master\",\"Received the gift divine,\",\"And still that light is lifted\",\"O\'er all the earth to shine.\",\"It is the golden casket,\",\"Where gems of truth are stored;\",\"It is the heaven-drawn picture\",\"Of Christ, the living Word.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0217', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"It floateth like a banner\",\"Before God\'s host unfurled;\",\"It shines like a beacon\",\"Above the darkling world.\",\"It is the chart and compass\",\"That o\'er life\'s surging sea,\",\"\'Mid mists and rocks and quicksands,\",\"Still guides, O Christ, to Thee.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0217', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"O make thy church, dear Saviour,\",\"A lamp of purest gold,\",\"To bear before the nations\",\"Thy true light as of old.\",\"O teach thy wandering pilgrims\",\"By this their path to trace,\",\"Till, clouds and darkness ended,\",\"They see thee face to face.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0218', 218, 'Break Thou the Bread of Life', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Break thou the bread of life,
Dear Lord, to me,
As thou didst break the loaves
Beside the sea;
Beyond the sacred page
I seek thee, Lord;
My spirit pants for thee,
O living Word!
Bless thou the truth revealed
This day to me,
As thou didst bless the bread
By Galilee;
Then shall all bondage cease,
All fetters fall;
And I shall find in thee,
My all in all!
Spirit and life are they,
Words thou dost speak;
I hasten to obey,
But I am weak;
Thou art my only help,
Thou art my life;
Heeding thy holy word
I win the strife.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0218', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Break thou the bread of life,\",\"Dear Lord, to me,\",\"As thou didst break the loaves\",\"Beside the sea;\",\"Beyond the sacred page\",\"I seek thee, Lord;\",\"My spirit pants for thee,\",\"O living Word!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0218', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Bless thou the truth revealed\",\"This day to me,\",\"As thou didst bless the bread\",\"By Galilee;\",\"Then shall all bondage cease,\",\"All fetters fall;\",\"And I shall find in thee,\",\"My all in all!\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0218', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Spirit and life are they,\",\"Words thou dost speak;\",\"I hasten to obey,\",\"But I am weak;\",\"Thou art my only help,\",\"Thou art my life;\",\"Heeding thy holy word\",\"I win the strife.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0219', 219, 'Holy Bible! Book divine', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Holy Bible! Book divine!
Precious treasure, thou art mine!
Mine to tell me whence I came;
Mine to teach me what I am.
Mine to chide me when I rove;
Mine to show a Savior’s love;
Mine to guide my wayward feet;
Mine to judge, condemn, acquit.
Mine to comfort in distress;
If the Holy Spirit bless;
Mine to show by living faith,
Man can triumph over death.
Mine to tell of joys to come,
In the saint\'s eternal home:
O thou holy Book divine,
Precious treasure, thou art mine!
I win the strife.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0219', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Holy Bible! Book divine!\",\"Precious treasure, thou art mine!\",\"Mine to tell me whence I came;\",\"Mine to teach me what I am.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0219', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Mine to chide me when I rove;\",\"Mine to show a Savior’s love;\",\"Mine to guide my wayward feet;\",\"Mine to judge, condemn, acquit.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0219', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Mine to comfort in distress;\",\"If the Holy Spirit bless;\",\"Mine to show by living faith,\",\"Man can triumph over death.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0219', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Mine to tell of joys to come,\",\"In the saint\'s eternal home:\",\"O thou holy Book divine,\",\"Precious treasure, thou art mine!\",\"I win the strife.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0220', 220, 'I Love the Sacred Book', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I love the sacred book of God,
No other can its place supply;
It points me to the saints\' abode,
And bids me from destruction fly.
Sweet book! in thee my eyes discern
The image of my absent Lord;');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0220', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"I love the sacred book of God,\",\"No other can its place supply;\",\"It points me to the saints\' abode,\",\"And bids me from destruction fly.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0220', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Sweet book! in thee my eyes discern\",\"The image of my absent Lord;\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0221', 221, 'Return, O Wanderer', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Return, O wanderer, return,
And seek thy Father\'s face;
Those new desires which in thee burn,
Were kindled by His grace.
Return, O wanderer, return;
He hears thy humble sigh;
He sees thy softened spirit mourn,
When no one else is nigh.
Return, O wanderer, return;
Thy Saviour bids thee live;
Come to his cross, and, grateful, learn
How freely He\'ll forgive.
Return, O wanderer, return;
And wipe the falling tear;
Thy Father calls-no longer mourn;
\'Tis love invites thee near.
Return, O wanderer, return;
Regain thy long, sought rest;
The Saviour\'s melting mercies yearn
To clasp thee to his breast.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0221', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Return, O wanderer, return,\",\"And seek thy Father\'s face;\",\"Those new desires which in thee burn,\",\"Were kindled by His grace.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0221', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Return, O wanderer, return;\",\"He hears thy humble sigh;\",\"He sees thy softened spirit mourn,\",\"When no one else is nigh.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0221', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Return, O wanderer, return;\",\"Thy Saviour bids thee live;\",\"Come to his cross, and, grateful, learn\",\"How freely He\'ll forgive.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0221', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Return, O wanderer, return;\",\"And wipe the falling tear;\",\"Thy Father calls-no longer mourn;\",\"\'Tis love invites thee near.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0221', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Return, O wanderer, return;\",\"Regain thy long, sought rest;\",\"The Saviour\'s melting mercies yearn\",\"To clasp thee to his breast.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0222', 222, 'Just as I Am', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Just as I am, without one plea
But that thy blood was shed for me,
And that thou bid\'st me come to thee,
O Lamb of God, I come, I come.
Just as I am, and waiting not
To rid my soul of one dark blot,
To thee, whose blood can cleanse each spot,
O Lamb of God, I come, I come.
Just as I am, though tossed about
With many a conflict, many a doubt;
“Fightings within, and fears without,”
O Lamb of God, I come, I come.
Just as I am, poor, wretched, blind;
Sight, riches, healing of the mind,
Yea, all I need in thee to find,
O Lamb of God, I come, I come.
Just as I am, thou wilt receive,
Wilt welcome, pardon, cleanse, relieve;
Because thy promise I believe,
O Lamb of God, I come, I come.
Just as I am, thy love I own
Has broken every barrier down;
Now, to be thine, and thine alone,
O Lamb of God, I come, I come.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0222', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Just as I am, without one plea\",\"But that thy blood was shed for me,\",\"And that thou bid\'st me come to thee,\",\"O Lamb of God, I come, I come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0222', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Just as I am, and waiting not\",\"To rid my soul of one dark blot,\",\"To thee, whose blood can cleanse each spot,\",\"O Lamb of God, I come, I come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0222', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Just as I am, though tossed about\",\"With many a conflict, many a doubt;\",\"“Fightings within, and fears without,”\",\"O Lamb of God, I come, I come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0222', 'verse', 4, 3, '[\"Just as I am, poor, wretched, blind;\",\"Sight, riches, healing of the mind,\",\"Yea, all I need in thee to find,\",\"O Lamb of God, I come, I come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0222', 'verse', 5, 4, '[\"Just as I am, thou wilt receive,\",\"Wilt welcome, pardon, cleanse, relieve;\",\"Because thy promise I believe,\",\"O Lamb of God, I come, I come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0222', 'verse', 6, 5, '[\"Just as I am, thy love I own\",\"Has broken every barrier down;\",\"Now, to be thine, and thine alone,\",\"O Lamb of God, I come, I come.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0223', 223, 'Come, Ye Disconsolate', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, ye disconsolate, where\'er ye languish;
Come to the mercy seat, fervently kneel;
Here bring your wounded hearts, here tell your anguish;
Earth has no sorrow that heaven cannot heal.
Joy of the comfortless, light of the straying,
Hope of the penitent, fadeless and pure!
Here speaks the Comforter, tenderly saying,
\"Earth has no sorrow that heaven cannot cure.\"
Here see the Bread of Life; see waters flowing
Forth from the throne of God, pure from above;
Come to the feast of love — come, ever knowing
Earth has no sorrow but heaven can remove.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0223', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"Come, ye disconsolate, where\'er ye languish;\",\"Come to the mercy seat, fervently kneel;\",\"Here bring your wounded hearts, here tell your anguish;\",\"Earth has no sorrow that heaven cannot heal.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0223', 'verse', 2, 1, '[\"Joy of the comfortless, light of the straying,\",\"Hope of the penitent, fadeless and pure!\",\"Here speaks the Comforter, tenderly saying,\",\"\\\"Earth has no sorrow that heaven cannot cure.\\\"\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0223', 'verse', 3, 2, '[\"Here see the Bread of Life; see waters flowing\",\"Forth from the throne of God, pure from above;\",\"Come to the feast of love — come, ever knowing\",\"Earth has no sorrow but heaven can remove.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0224', 224, 'I Hear Thy Welcome Voice', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I hear thy welcome voice,
That calls me, Lord, to thee;
For cleansing in thy precious blood,
That flowed on Calvary.
I am coming, Lord!
Coming now to thee!
Wash me, cleanse me, in the blood
That flowed on Calvary.
Though coming weak and vile,
Thou dost my strength assure;
Thou dost my vileness fully cleanse,
Till spotless all, and pure.
\'Tis Jesus calls me on
To perfect faith and love,
To perfect hope, and peace, and trust,
For earth and heaven above.
All hail, atoning blood!
All hail, redeeming grace!
All hail! the gift of Christ, our Lord,
Our Strength and Righteousness.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0224', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"I hear thy welcome voice,\",\"That calls me, Lord, to thee;\",\"For cleansing in thy precious blood,\",\"That flowed on Calvary.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0224', 'chorus', 0, 1, '[\"I am coming, Lord!\",\"Coming now to thee!\",\"Wash me, cleanse me, in the blood\",\"That flowed on Calvary.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0224', 'verse', 2, 2, '[\"Though coming weak and vile,\",\"Thou dost my strength assure;\",\"Thou dost my vileness fully cleanse,\",\"Till spotless all, and pure.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0224', 'verse', 3, 3, '[\"\'Tis Jesus calls me on\",\"To perfect faith and love,\",\"To perfect hope, and peace, and trust,\",\"For earth and heaven above.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0224', 'verse', 4, 4, '[\"All hail, atoning blood!\",\"All hail, redeeming grace!\",\"All hail! the gift of Christ, our Lord,\",\"Our Strength and Righteousness.\"]');
INSERT INTO tblSongs (SongId, Number, Title, SongbookAbbr, Language, Copyright, Ccli, Verified, LyricsPublicDomain, MusicPublicDomain, HasAudio, HasSheetMusic, LyricsText) VALUES ('CH-0225', 225, 'I Heard the Voice of Jesus Say', 'CH', 'en', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I heard the voice of Jesus say,
\"Come unto me and rest;
Lay down, thou weary one, lay down
Thy head upon my breast.\"
I came to Jesus as I was,
Weary and worn and sad;
I found in him a resting place,
And he has made me glad.
I heard the voice of Jesus say,
\"Behold, I freely give
The living water; thirsty one,
Stoop down and drink and live.\"
I came to Jesus, and I drank
Of that life-giving stream;
My thirst was quenched, my soul revived,
And now I live in him.
I heard the voice of Jesus say,
\"I am this dark world\'s Light.
Look unto me; thy morn shall rise
And all thy day be bright.\"
I looked to Jesus, and I found
In him my Star, my Sun;
And in that Light of Life I\'ll walk,
Till traveling days are done.');
INSERT INTO tblSongComponents (SongId, Type, Number, SortOrder, LinesJson) VALUES ('CH-0225', 'verse', 1, 0, '[\"I heard the voice of Jesus say,\",\"\\\"Come unto me and rest;\",\"Lay down, thou weary one, lay down\",\"Thy head upon my breast.\\\"\",\"I came to Jesus as I was,\",\"Weary and worn and sad;\",\"I found in him a resting place,\",\"And he has made me glad.\"]');
